#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:23
msgid "The Administration Control Panel"
msgstr "Administratorkontrolpanelet"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:24
msgid ""
"Even more so than its predecessor, phpBB 3.3 \"Proteus\" is highly "
"configurable. You can tune, adjust, or turn off almost all features. To make"
" this load of settings as accessible as possible, we redesigned the "
"Administration Control Panel (ACP) completely."
msgstr ""
"Endnu mere end sin forgænger er phpBB 3.3 \"Proteus\" yderst konfigurerbart."
" Du kan finjustere, tilpasse eller slå næsten alle funktioner fra. For at "
"gøre denne mængde af indstillinger så tilgængelig som muligt, har vi "
"redesignet administratorkontrolpanelet (ACP) fuldstændigt."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:25
msgid ""
"Click on the <guilabel>Administration Control Panel</guilabel> link on the "
"bottom of the default forum style to visit the <acronym>ACP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Klik på linket <guilabel>Administratorkontrolpanel</guilabel> nederst i "
"standardtypografien for at besøge <acronym>ACP</acronym>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:26
msgid ""
"The <acronym>ACP</acronym> has seven different sections by default with each"
" containing a number of subsections. We will discuss each section in this "
"Admin Guide."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>ACP</acronym> har som standard syv forskellige sektioner, hver med "
"en række undersektioner. Vi gennemgår hver sektion i denne "
"administratorvejledning."

