#. (itstool) path: caption/para
#: admin_guide.xml:35
msgid ""
"The Administration Control Panel Index, the home of managing your phpBB "
"board. Administration functions are grouped into eight different categories:"
" <guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Forums</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Posting</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Users and "
"Groups</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Permissions</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Styles</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Maintenance</guimenuitem>, "
"and <guimenuitem>System</guimenuitem>. Each category is a tab located at the"
" top of the page. Specific functions of the category you're in can be found "
"in the left-hand sidebar of each page."
msgstr ""
"Administratorkontrolpanelets indeks, hjemstedet for administrationen af dit "
"phpBB-board. Administrationsfunktionerne er grupperet i otte forskellige "
"kategorier: <guimenuitem>Generelt</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Fora</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Indlæg</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Brugere og grupper</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Tilladelser</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Typografier</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Vedligeholdelse</guimenuitem> og "
"<guimenuitem>System</guimenuitem>. Hver kategori er en fane øverst på siden."
" Specifikke funktioner for den kategori du befinder dig i, findes i venstre "
"sidebjælke på hver side."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:49
msgid "General Configuration and Front Page"
msgstr "Generel konfiguration og forsiden"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:50
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem> section is the first screen you see "
"each time you log into the <acronym>ACP</acronym>. It contains some basic "
"statistics and information about your forum. It also has a subsection called"
" <guimenuitem>Quick Access</guimenuitem>. It provides quick access to some "
"of the admin pages that are frequently used, like <link "
"linkend=\"acp_users\">User Management</link> or <link "
"linkend=\"acp_maintenance\">Moderator Logs</link>. We will discuss its items"
" later in their specific sections."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen <guimenuitem>Generelt</guimenuitem> er det første skærmbillede, du"
" ser hver gang du logger ind i <acronym>ACP</acronym>. Den indeholder nogle "
"grundlæggende statistikker og oplysninger om dit forum. Den har også en "
"undersektion kaldet <guimenuitem>Hurtig adgang</guimenuitem>, som giver "
"hurtig adgang til nogle af de administratorsider, der ofte bruges, såsom "
"<link linkend=\"acp_users\">Brugeradministration</link> eller <link "
"linkend=\"acp_maintenance\">Redaktørlogs</link>. Vi gennemgår dens elementer"
" senere i deres respektive sektioner."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:51
msgid ""
"We will concentrate on the other three subsections: <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_config\">Board Configuration</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_client\">Client Communication</link>, and <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_server\">Server Configuration</link>."
msgstr ""
"Vi vil koncentrere os om de tre andre undersektioner: <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_config\">Boardkonfiguration</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_client\">Klientkommunikation</link> og <link "
"linkend=\"acp_general_server\">Serverkonfiguration</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:60
msgid "Board Configuration"
msgstr "Boardkonfiguration"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:61
msgid ""
"This subsection contains items to adjust the overall features and settings "
"of the forum."
msgstr ""
"Denne undersektion indeholder elementer til at justere forummets overordnede"
" funktioner og indstillinger."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:71 admin_guide.xml:1042 admin_guide.xml:1047
msgid "Attachment Settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for vedhæftede filer"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:72
msgid ""
"One of the many features in phpBB 3.3 is <glossterm>Attachments</glossterm>."
" Attachments are files that can be attached to posts, like e-mail "
"attachments. Certain restrictions, set by the board administrator, control "
"what users can attach. You can set these restrictions via the "
"<guimenuitem>Attachment Settings</guimenuitem> page."
msgstr ""
"En af de mange funktioner i phpBB 3.3 er <glossterm>vedhæftede "
"filer</glossterm>. Vedhæftede filer er filer, der kan vedhæftes indlæg, "
"ligesom e-mailvedhæftninger. Bestemte restriktioner, fastsat af "
"boardadministratoren, bestemmer hvad brugere kan vedhæfte. Du kan indstille "
"disse restriktioner via siden <guimenuitem>Indstillinger for vedhæftede "
"filer</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:73
msgid ""
"For more information, see the section on <link "
"linkend=\"acp_attach_settings\">configuring your board's attachment "
"settings</link>."
msgstr ""
"For mere information, se afsnittet om <link "
"linkend=\"acp_attach_settings\">konfiguration af boardets indstillinger for "
"vedhæftede filer</link>."

