#. (itstool) path: section/title
#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:88 admin_guide.xml:92
msgid "Board Settings"
msgstr "Boardindstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:89
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Board Settings</guimenuitem> allow you to change many "
"settings that govern your board. These settings include important things "
"such as the name of your forum! There are two main groups of board settings:"
" the general <guilabel>Board Settings</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Warnings</guilabel> settings."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Boardindstillinger</guimenuitem> giver dig mulighed for at "
"ændre mange indstillinger, der styrer dit board. Disse indstillinger "
"omfatter vigtige ting som navnet på dit forum! Der er to hovedgrupper af "
"boardindstillinger: de generelle <guilabel>Boardindstillinger</guilabel> og "
"indstillinger for <guilabel>Advarsler</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:93
msgid ""
"The very first board setting you can edit is perhaps the most important "
"setting of them all: the name of your board. Your users identify your board "
"with this name. Put the name of your site into the <guilabel>Site "
"Name</guilabel> text field and it will be shown on the header of the default"
" style; it will be the prefix to the window title of your browser."
msgstr ""
"Den allerførste boardindstilling, du kan redigere, er måske den vigtigste af"
" dem alle: navnet på dit board. Dine brugere identificerer dit board med "
"dette navn. Angiv navnet på dit site i tekstfeltet "
"<guilabel>Sitenavn</guilabel>, og det vil blive vist i headeren for "
"standardtypografien; det vil også være præfikset til vinduestitlen i din "
"browser."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:94
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Site Description</guilabel> is the slogan or tagline of your "
"forum. It will appear below the <guilabel>Site Name</guilabel> on the "
"default style's header."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sitebeskrivelse</guilabel> er dit forums slogan eller tagline. Den"
" vises under <guilabel>Sitenavn</guilabel> i standardtypografiens header."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:95
msgid ""
"You can also use the <guilabel>Main website URL</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Main website text</guilabel> fields to add a link to your home "
"page in the breadcrumbs. The board's logo will also use this link."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også bruge felterne <guilabel>Hovedwebsitets URL</guilabel> og "
"<guilabel>Hovedwebsitets tekst</guilabel> til at tilføje et link til din "
"hjemmeside i brødkrummestien. Boardets logo bruger også dette link."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:96
msgid ""
"If you need to close your whole forum to do maintenance work, for instance, "
"you can do it by using the <guilabel>Disable Board</guilabel> switch. To "
"temporarily disable your board, select<guilabel>Yes</guilabel>. This will "
"keep any members of your forum who are not administrators or moderators from"
" accessing your board. They will either see a default message instead of the"
" forum, or a message that you create. You can add your own custom message "
"that will be displayed when your board is disabled in the text box below the"
" <guilabel>Disable board</guilabel> radio buttons. Administrators and "
"moderators will still be able to browse forums and use their specific "
"control panels when the board is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Skal du lukke hele forummet for at udføre vedligeholdelsesarbejde, kan du "
"gøre dette med kontakten <guilabel>Deaktivér board</guilabel>. For "
"midlertidigt at deaktivere dit board, vælg <guilabel>Ja</guilabel>. Dette "
"forhindrer medlemmer af dit forum, der ikke er administratorer eller "
"redaktører, i at tilgå dit board. De vil enten se en standardbesked i stedet"
" for forummet, eller en besked du selv opretter. Du kan tilføje din egen "
"brugerdefinerede besked, der vises når dit board er deaktiveret, i "
"tekstfeltet under radioknapperne for <guilabel>Deaktivér board</guilabel>. "
"Administratorer og redaktører kan stadig gennemse fora og bruge deres "
"respektive kontrolpaneler, mens boardet er deaktiveret."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:97
msgid ""
"You also need to set the <guilabel>Default Language</guilabel> of your "
"board. This is the language that guests will see when they visit your board."
" You can allow registered users to choose other languages. By default, the "
"only language installed is <guilabel>English [GB]</guilabel>, but you can "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/languages\">download more languages on "
"the phpBB website</ulink> and install them on your board. Find out more "
"about working with languages in the <link "
"linkend=\"acp_customise_language\">section on Language Pack "
"configuration</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du skal også angive boardets <guilabel>Standardsprog</guilabel>. Det er det "
"sprog, gæster ser, når de besøger dit board. Du kan tillade tilmeldte "
"brugere at vælge andre sprog. Som standard er kun <guilabel>English "
"[GB]</guilabel> installeret, men du kan <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/languages\">downloade flere sprog på phpBB's "
"website</ulink> og installere dem på dit board. Læs mere om at arbejde med "
"sprog i <link linkend=\"acp_customise_language\">afsnittet om konfiguration "
"af sprogpakker</link>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:98
msgid ""
"You can also configure your board's default date format. phpBB3 has a few "
"basic date formats that you can set your board to use; if these are not "
"sufficient and you would like to customise your board's date format, choose "
"<guimenuitem>Custom</guimenuitem> from the <guilabel>Date format</guilabel> "
"selection menu. Then, in the text box besides it, type in the format you "
"would like to use. This is the same as the <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.php.net/date\">PHP date() function</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også konfigurere boardets standarddatoformat. phpBB3 har nogle "
"grundlæggende datoformater, du kan indstille dit board til at bruge; er "
"disse ikke tilstrækkelige, og du ønsker at tilpasse boardets datoformat, "
"vælg <guimenuitem>Brugerdefineret</guimenuitem> fra dropdownmenuen "
"<guilabel>Datoformat</guilabel>. Angiv derefter det ønskede format i "
"tekstfeltet ved siden af. Dette svarer til <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.php.net/date\">PHP's date()-funktion</ulink>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:99
msgid ""
"Along with setting your board's default date format, you can also set your "
"board's preferred timezone. The timezones available in the <guilabel>System "
"timezone</guilabel> selection menu are all based on relative "
"<acronym>UTC</acronym> (for most intents and purposes, it is "
"<acronym>GMT</acronym>, or Greenwich Mean Time) times."
msgstr ""
"Ud over at indstille boardets standarddatoformat, kan du også indstille "
"boardets foretrukne tidszone. Tidszonerne tilgængelige i dropdownmenuen "
"<guilabel>Systemtidszone</guilabel> er alle baseret på relative "
"<acronym>UTC</acronym>-tider (for de fleste formål svarer dette til "
"<acronym>GMT</acronym>, Greenwich middeltid)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:100
msgid ""
"You can also set your board's default style. The board will appear to your "
"guests and members in the <guilabel>Default Style</guilabel>. In the "
"standard phpBB installation, two styles are available: prosilver and "
"subsilver2. You can either allow users to select another style than the "
"default by selecting <guilabel>No</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Override User "
"Style</guilabel> setting or disallow it. Please visit the <link "
"linkend=\"acp_customise_styles\">styles section</link> to find out how to "
"add new styles and where to find some."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også indstille boardets standardtypografi. Boardet vises til dine "
"gæster og medlemmer i <guilabel>Standardtypografi</guilabel>. I en standard "
"phpBB-installation er to typografier tilgængelige: prosilver og subsilver2. "
"Du kan enten tillade brugere at vælge en anden typografi end standarden ved "
"at vælge <guilabel>Nej</guilabel> i indstillingen <guilabel>Tilsidesæt "
"brugertypografi</guilabel>, eller forhindre det. Besøg venligst <link "
"linkend=\"acp_customise_styles\">typografisektionen</link> for at finde ud "
"af hvordan du tilføjer nye typografier, og hvor du kan finde nogle."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:104 admin_guide.xml:1220
msgid "Warnings"
msgstr "Advarsler"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:105
msgid ""
"Moderators can send warnings to users that break the forum rules. The value "
"of <guilabel>Warning Duration</guilabel> defines the number of days a "
"warning is valid until it expires. All positive integers are valid values. "
"For more about warnings, please read <xref linkend=\"moderator_mcp\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Redaktører kan sende advarsler til brugere, der bryder forummets regler. "
"Værdien af <guilabel>Advarselsvarighed</guilabel> bestemmer antallet af "
"dage, en advarsel er gyldig, inden den udløber. Alle positive heltal er "
"gyldige værdier. Læs mere om advarsler i <xref linkend=\"moderator_mcp\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:117
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "Boardfunktioner"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:118
msgid ""
"Through the <guimenuitem>Board Features</guimenuitem> section, you can "
"enable or disable several features board-wide. Note that any feature you "
"disable here will not be available on your forum, even if you give your "
"users permissions to use them."
msgstr ""
"Via sektionen <guimenuitem>Boardfunktioner</guimenuitem> kan du aktivere "
"eller deaktivere flere funktioner for hele boardet. Bemærk at enhver "
"funktion, du deaktiverer her, ikke er tilgængelig på dit forum, selv hvis du"
" giver dine brugere tilladelse til at bruge den."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:119
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Load Settings</guimenuitem> section allows you to disable "
"some features which are computationally expensive if you are on shared or "
"restricted hosting."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen <guimenuitem>Belastningsindstillinger</guimenuitem> giver dig "
"mulighed for at deaktivere visse funktioner, der er beregningsmæssigt tunge,"
" hvis du kører på delt eller begrænset webhosting."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:130
msgid "Avatar Settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for avatarer"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:131
msgid ""
"Avatars are generally small, unique images a user can associate with "
"themselves. Depending on the style, they are usually displayed below the "
"user name when viewing topics. Here you can determine how users can define "
"their avatars."
msgstr ""
"Avatarer er som regel små, unikke billeder, en bruger kan tilknytte sig "
"selv. Afhængigt af typografien vises de normalt under brugernavnet, når "
"emner ses. Her kan du bestemme hvordan brugere kan angive deres avatarer."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:132
msgid ""
"There are several ways a user can add an avatar to their profile. The first "
"way is through <guilabel>Gravatar</guilabel>. If this feature is enabled, "
"users can choose to have the board load the Gravatar.com image associated "
"with their email address."
msgstr ""
"Der er flere måder, en bruger kan tilføje en avatar til sin profil. Den "
"første måde er via <guilabel>Gravatar</guilabel>. Er denne funktion "
"aktiveret, kan brugere vælge at lade boardet indlæse det Gravatar.com-"
"billede, der er tilknyttet deres e-mailadresse."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:133
msgid ""
"The second way is through an avatar gallery you provide. Note that there is "
"no avatar gallery available in a default phpBB installation. The "
"<guilabel>Avatar Gallery Path</guilabel> is the path to the gallery images. "
"The default path is <guilabel>images/avatars/gallery</guilabel>. The gallery"
" folder does not exist in the default installation so you have to add it "
"manually if you want to use it."
msgstr ""
"Den anden måde er via et avatargalleri, du selv stiller til rådighed. Bemærk"
" at der ikke findes noget avatargalleri i en standard phpBB-installation. "
"<guilabel>Sti til avatargalleri</guilabel> er stien til galleribillederne. "
"Standardstien er <guilabel>images/avatars/gallery</guilabel>. Gallerimappen "
"findes ikke i standardinstallationen, så du skal selv tilføje den manuelt, "
"hvis du ønsker at bruge den."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:134
msgid ""
"The images you want to use for your gallery need to be in a folder inside "
"the gallery path. Images directly in the gallery path won't be recognised."
msgstr ""
"Billederne du ønsker at bruge til dit galleri, skal være i en mappe inde i "
"galleristien. Billeder placeret direkte i galleristien vil ikke blive "
"genkendt."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:135
msgid ""
"The third approach to avatars is through <guilabel>Avatar "
"Uploading</guilabel>. Your members can upload an image from their local "
"system which will be stored on your server. They will be uploaded into the "
"<guilabel>Avatar Storage Path</guilabel> you can define. The default path is"
" <guilabel>images/avatars/upload</guilabel> and does already exist after "
"installation. You have to make sure that it is <glossterm>server-"
"writable</glossterm>. The file format of the images has to be either gif, "
"jpeg, or png, and the avatars will be automatically checked for their file "
"and image size after the upload. You can adjust the <guilabel>Maximum Avatar"
" File Size</guilabel> and images that are bigger than the allowed value will"
" be discarded."
msgstr ""
"Den tredje tilgang til avatarer er via <guilabel>Upload af "
"avatar</guilabel>. Dine medlemmer kan uploade et billede fra deres lokale "
"system, som gemmes på din server. De uploades til <guilabel>Lagringssti for "
"avatarer</guilabel>, som du selv kan definere. Standardstien er "
"<guilabel>images/avatars/upload</guilabel> og findes allerede efter "
"installationen. Du skal sikre dig, at den er <glossterm>skrivbar</glossterm>"
" for serveren. Billedernes filformat skal være enten gif, jpeg eller png, og"
" avatarerne kontrolleres automatisk for deres fil- og billedstørrelse efter "
"upload. Du kan justere <guilabel>Maksimal filstørrelse for "
"avatar</guilabel>, og billeder større end den tilladte værdi vil blive "
"afvist."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:146
msgid "Private Messaging"
msgstr "Private beskeder"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:147
msgid ""
"<glossterm>Private Messages</glossterm> are a way for registered members to "
"communicate privately through your board without the need to fall back to "
"e-mail or instant messaging."
msgstr ""
"<glossterm>Private beskeder</glossterm> er en måde, hvorpå tilmeldte "
"medlemmer kan kommunikere privat gennem dit board uden at skulle ty til "
"e-mail eller instant messaging."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:148
msgid ""
"You can disable this feature with the <guilabel>Private Messaging</guilabel>"
" setting. This will keep the feature turned off for the whole board. You can"
" disable private messages for selected users or groups with <link "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Permissions</link>. Please see the <link "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Permissions section</link> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Du kan deaktivere denne funktion med indstillingen <guilabel>Private "
"beskeder</guilabel>. Dette slår funktionen fra for hele boardet. Du kan "
"deaktivere private beskeder for udvalgte brugere eller grupper med <link "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Tilladelser</link>. Se venligst <link "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Tilladelser-sektionen</link> for mere "
"information."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:149
msgid ""
"Proteus allows users to create own personal folders to organise Private "
"Messages. The <guilabel>Maximum private message folders</guilabel> setting "
"defines the number of message folders they can create. The default value is "
"4. You can disable the feature with setting value to 0."
msgstr ""
"Proteus giver brugere mulighed for at oprette egne personlige mapper til at "
"organisere private beskeder. Indstillingen <guilabel>Maksimalt antal mapper "
"til private beskeder</guilabel> bestemmer antallet af beskedmapper, de kan "
"oprette. Standardværdien er 4. Du kan deaktivere funktionen ved at sætte "
"værdien til 0."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:150
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max Private Messages Per Box</guilabel> sets the number of Private"
" Messages each folder can contain. The default value is "
"<guilabel>50</guilabel>, Set it to 0 to allow unlimited messages per folder."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimalt antal private beskeder pr. mappe</guilabel> angiver "
"antallet af private beskeder, hver mappe kan indeholde. Standardværdien er "
"<guilabel>50</guilabel>. Sæt den til 0 for at tillade ubegrænset antal "
"beskeder pr. mappe."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:151
msgid ""
"If you limit the number of messages users can store in their folders, you "
"need to define a default action that is taken once a folder is full. This "
"can be changed in the \"Full Folder Default Action\" list. The oldest "
"message gets deleted or the new message will be held back until the folder "
"has place for it. Note that users will be able to choose this for themselves"
" in their PM options and this setting only changes the default value they "
"face. This will not override the action a user chosen."
msgstr ""
"Begrænser du antallet af beskeder, brugere kan gemme i deres mapper, skal du"
" definere en standardhandling, der udføres, når en mappe er fuld. Dette kan "
"ændres på listen \"Standardhandling ved fuld mappe\". Enten slettes den "
"ældste besked, eller også tilbageholdes den nye besked, indtil mappen har "
"plads til den. Bemærk at brugere selv kan vælge dette i deres indstillinger "
"for private beskeder, og denne indstilling ændrer kun den standardværdi, de "
"møder. Dette tilsidesætter ikke en handling, en bruger selv har valgt."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:152
msgid ""
"When sending a private message, it is still possible to edit the message "
"until the recipient reads it. After a sent private message has been read, "
"editing the message is no longer possible. To limit the time a message can "
"be edited before the recipient reads it, you can set the <guilabel>Limit "
"Editing Time</guilabel>. The default value is 0, which allows editing until "
"the message is read. Note that you can disallow users or groups to edit "
"Private Messages after sending through <link "
"linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Permissions</link>. If the permission to edit "
"messages is denied, it will override this setting."
msgstr ""
"Når der sendes en privat besked, er det stadig muligt at redigere beskeden, "
"indtil modtageren læser den. Efter en sendt privat besked er blevet læst, er"
" det ikke længere muligt at redigere den. For at begrænse hvor længe en "
"besked kan redigeres, før modtageren læser den, kan du indstille "
"<guilabel>Begræns redigeringstid</guilabel>. Standardværdien er 0, hvilket "
"tillader redigering, indtil beskeden er læst. Bemærk at du kan forhindre "
"brugere eller grupper i at redigere private beskeder efter afsendelse via "
"<link linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Tilladelser</link>. Er tilladelsen til at "
"redigere beskeder nægtet, tilsidesætter dette denne indstilling."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:156
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allow Mass PMs:</guilabel> enables the sending of Private Messages"
" to multiple recipients. This feature is enabled by default. Disabling it "
"will also disallow sending of Private Messages to groups."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tillad masse-PB'er:</guilabel> aktiverer afsendelse af private "
"beskeder til flere modtagere. Denne funktion er aktiveret som standard. "
"Deaktiveres den, forhindres også afsendelse af private beskeder til grupper."

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: admin_guide.xml:158
msgid ""
"See the <link linkend=\"acp_groups\">Groups section</link> for information "
"on how to enable the ability to send a message to a whole group."
msgstr ""
"Se <link linkend=\"acp_groups\">Gruppesektionen</link> for information om, "
"hvordan du aktiverer muligheden for at sende en besked til en hel gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:162
msgid ""
"By default, <glossterm>BBCode</glossterm> and <glossterm>Smilies</glossterm>"
