msgstr ""
"Selv hvis aktiveret, kan du stadig forhindre brugere eller grupper i at "
"bruge <glossterm>BBkode</glossterm> og <glossterm>smileys</glossterm> i "
"private beskeder via <link linkend=\"acp_permissions\">Tilladelser</link>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:168
msgid ""
"We don't allow attachments by default. Further settings for attachments in "
"Private Messages are in the <link "
"linkend=\"acp_board_attachments\">Attachment Settings</link>. There you can "
"define the number of attachments per message for instance."
msgstr ""
"Vi tillader som standard ikke vedhæftede filer. Yderligere indstillinger for"
" vedhæftede filer i private beskeder findes under <link "
"linkend=\"acp_board_attachments\">Indstillinger for vedhæftede filer</link>."
" Der kan du f.eks. definere antallet af vedhæftede filer pr. besked."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:153
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>General Options</guilabel> allow you to further define the "
