#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:302
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "E-mailindstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:304
msgid ""
"phpBB3 is capable of sending out emails to your users. Here, you can "
"configure the information that is used when your board sends out these "
"emails. phpBB3 can send out emails by using either the native, PHP-based "
"email service, or a specified <glossterm>SMTP</glossterm> server. If you are"
" not sure if you have an SMTP server available, use the native email "
"service. You will have to ask your hoster for further details. Once you are "
"done configuring the email settings, click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"phpBB3 kan sende e-mails ud til dine brugere. Her kan du konfigurere de "
"oplysninger, der bruges når dit board sender disse e-mails. phpBB3 kan sende"
" e-mails ved brug af enten den native, PHP-baserede e-mailtjeneste, eller en"
" angivet <glossterm>SMTP</glossterm>-server. Er du ikke sikker på om du har "
"en SMTP-server til rådighed, brug den native e-mailtjeneste. Du bliver nødt "
"til at spørge din webhost for flere detaljer. Når du er færdig med at "
"konfigurere e-mailindstillingerne, klik på <guilabel>Send</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: admin_guide.xml:307
msgid ""
"Please ensure the email address you specify is valid, as any bounced or "
