"url=\"http://www.jabber.org\">jabber.org</ulink>'s <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.jabber.org/user/publicservers.shtml\">liste over åbne, "
"offentlige servere</ulink>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:353
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Jabber port</guilabel>: The port that the Jabber server specified "
