" øjeblikkeligt og sættes ikke i kø til senere afsendelse."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:372
msgid "Server configuration"
msgstr "Serverkonfiguration"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:373
msgid ""
"As an administrator of a board, being able to fine-tune the settings that "
"your phpBB board uses for the server is a must. Configuring your board's "
"server settings is very easy. There are five main categories of server "
"settings: <guimenuitem>Cookie settings</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Server "
"settings</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Security settings</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Load settings</guimenuitem>, and <guimenuitem>Search "
"settings</guimenuitem>. Properly configuring these settings will help your "
"board not only function, but also work efficiently and as intended. The "
"following subsections will outline each server configuration category. Once "
"you are done with updating settings in each setting, remember to click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel> to apply your changes."
msgstr ""
"Som administrator af et board er det et must at kunne finjustere de "
"indstillinger, dit phpBB-board bruger for serveren. Det er meget nemt at "
"konfigurere boardets serverindstillinger. Der er fem hovedkategorier af "
"serverindstillinger: <guimenuitem>Cookieindstillinger</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Serverindstillinger</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Sikkerhedsindstillinger</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Belastningsindstillinger</guimenuitem> og "
"<guimenuitem>Søgeindstillinger</guimenuitem>. Korrekt konfiguration af disse"
" indstillinger hjælper dit board med ikke blot at fungere, men også at "
"arbejde effektivt og som tilsigtet. De følgende undersektioner beskriver "
"hver serverkonfigurationskategori. Når du er færdig med at opdatere "
"indstillinger i hver indstilling, husk at klikke på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> for at anvende dine ændringer."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:387
msgid "Cookie settings"
msgstr "Cookieindstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:388
msgid ""
"Your board uses cookies all the time. Cookies can store information and "
"data; for example, cookies are what enable users to automatically login to "
"the board when they visit it. The settings on this page define the data used"
" to send cookies to your users' browsers."
msgstr ""
"Dit board bruger cookies hele tiden. Cookies kan gemme information og data; "
"f.eks. er det cookies, der gør det muligt for brugere automatisk at logge "
"ind på boardet, når de besøger det. Indstillingerne på denne side definerer "
"de data, der bruges til at sende cookies til dine brugeres browsere."

#. (itstool) path: warning/para
#: admin_guide.xml:391
msgid ""
"When editing your board's cookie settings, do so with caution. Incorrect "
"settings can cause such consequences as preventing your users from logging "
"in."
msgstr ""
"Vær forsigtig, når du redigerer boardets cookieindstillinger. Forkerte "
"indstillinger kan medføre konsekvenser som at forhindre dine brugere i at "
"logge ind."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:397
msgid "Cookie Settings"
msgstr "Cookieindstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:398
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cookie domain</guilabel>: This is the domain that your board runs "
"on. Do not include the path that phpBB is installed in; only the domain "
"itself is important here."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Cookiedomæne</guilabel>: Dette er det domæne, dit board kører på. "
"Medtag ikke stien, phpBB er installeret i; kun selve domænet er vigtigt her."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:399
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cookie name</guilabel>: This is the name that will be assigned to "
"the cookie when it is sent to your users' browsers and stored. This should "
"be a unique cookie name that will not conflict with any other cookies."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Cookienavn</guilabel>: Dette er det navn, der tildeles cookien, "
"når den sendes til dine brugeres browsere og gemmes. Dette bør være et unikt"
" cookienavn, der ikke er i konflikt med andre cookies."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:400
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cookie path</guilabel>: This is the path that the cookie will "
"apply to. In most cases, this should be left as \"/\", so that the cookie "
"can be accessible across your site. If for some reason you must restrict the"
" cookie to the path that your board is installed in, set the value to the "
"path of your board."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Cookiesti</guilabel>: Dette er den sti, cookien gælder for. I de "
"fleste tilfælde bør denne efterlades som \"/\", så cookien kan tilgås på "
"tværs af dit site. Er du af en eller anden grund nødt til at begrænse "
"cookien til den sti, dit board er installeret i, sæt værdien til stien for "
"dit board."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:401
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Cookie secure</guilabel>: If your board is only accessible via "
"<acronym>SSL</acronym>, set this to <guilabel>Enabled</guilabel>. If the "
"board is not accessible only via SSL, then leave this value set to "
"<guilabel>Disabled</guilabel>, otherwise server errors will result during "
"redirections and users may experience difficulties remaining logged in."
msgstr ""
