"<guilabel>Ja</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:591
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable topic marking for guests</guilabel>: It is also possible to"
" allow guests to have read/unread status information. If you want your board"
