#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:598
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Show user's activity</guilabel>: This option controls whether or "
"not the active topic/forum information displayed in your users' profiles and"
" <glossterm>UCP</glossterm>. If you want to show this user activity "
"information, select <guilabel>Yes</guilabel>. However, if your board has "
"more than one million posts, it is recommended that you disable this "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vis brugerens aktivitet</guilabel>: Denne indstilling styrer om "
"den aktive emne-/forumsinformation vises i dine brugeres profiler og "
"<glossterm>UCP</glossterm>. Ønsker du at vise denne "
"brugeraktivitetsinformation, vælg <guilabel>Ja</guilabel>. Har dit board dog"
" mere end en million indlæg, anbefales det at deaktivere denne funktion."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:599
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Recompile stale templates</guilabel>: This option controls the "
"recompilation of old templates. If this is enabled, your board will check to"
" see if there are updated templates on your filesystem; if there are, your "
"board will recompile the templates. Select <guilabel>Yes</guilabel> to "
"enable this option."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Genkompilér forældede skabeloner</guilabel>: Denne indstilling "
"styrer genkompileringen af gamle skabeloner. Er denne aktiveret, tjekker dit"
" board om der findes opdaterede skabeloner på dit filsystem; er der det, "
"genkompilerer dit board skabelonerne. Vælg <guilabel>Ja</guilabel> for at "
"aktivere denne indstilling."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:600
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allow usage of third party content delivery networks</guilabel>: "
"If this setting is enabled, some files will be served from external third "
"party servers (ajax.googleapis.com) instead of your server. This reduces the"
" network bandwidth required by your server, but may present a privacy issue "
"for some board administrators. In a default phpBB installation, this "
