" the amount of redundant topics are posted on your board. Here, on the "
"<guimenuitem>Search settings</guimenuitem> page, you can control what search"
" backend your board's search functionality will use for indexing posts and "
"searching, and set various options related to it. There are four main "
"categories of search settings: <guilabel>General Search Settings</guilabel>,"
" <guilabel>Search Backend</guilabel>, <guilabel>Fulltext mysql</guilabel>, "
"and <guilabel>Fulltext native</guilabel>. The following describes each set "
"of search settings in detail."
msgstr ""
"Dit board kan være en kilde til information. Det er meget vigtigt at kunne "
"søge effektivt gennem denne information, især ønsker du at reducere mængden "
"af overflødige emner, der skrives på dit board. Her, på siden "
"<guimenuitem>Søgeindstillinger</guimenuitem>, kan du styre hvilken "
"søgebackend dit boards søgefunktion bruger til indeksering af indlæg og "
"søgning, samt angive forskellige indstillinger relateret til dette. Der er "
"fire hovedkategorier af søgeindstillinger: <guilabel>Generelle "
"søgeindstillinger</guilabel>, <guilabel>Søgebackend</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Fulltext mysql</guilabel> og <guilabel>Fulltext native</guilabel>."
" Følgende beskriver hvert sæt søgeindstillinger i detaljer."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:629
msgid "General Search Settings"
msgstr "Generelle søgeindstillinger"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:630
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable search facilities</guilabel>: Setting this option to "
"<guilabel>Yes</guilabel> will enable the search functionality for your "
"users; member-searching functionality will also be enabled."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Aktivér søgefaciliteter</guilabel>: Sættes denne indstilling til "
"<guilabel>Ja</guilabel>, aktiveres søgefunktionen for dine brugere; "
"medlemssøgningsfunktionen aktiveres også."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:631
msgid ""
"<guilabel>User search flood interval</guilabel>: This value indicates the "
"number of seconds that your users have to wait between consecutive searches."
" This value is checked independently for each user. All positive integers "
"are valid values. If you want to disable checking for search intervals for "
"users, set this value to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Interval for brugersøgeflodbølge</guilabel>: Denne værdi angiver "
"det antal sekunder, dine brugere skal vente mellem på hinanden følgende "
"søgninger. Denne værdi tjekkes individuelt for hver bruger. Alle positive "
"heltal er gyldige værdier. Ønsker du at deaktivere tjek af søgeintervaller "
"for brugere, sæt denne værdi til \"0\"."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:632
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Guest search flood interval</guilabel>: This is the number of "
"seconds between searches that guest users must wait. This value is shared "
"for all guest users, if one guest searches, the others will have to wait "
"until this interval passes. All positive integers are valid values. If you "
"want to disable checking for search intervals for guests, set this value to "
"\"0\"."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Interval for gæstesøgeflodbølge</guilabel>: Dette er antallet af "
"sekunder mellem søgninger, gæstebrugere skal vente. Denne værdi deles af "
"alle gæstebrugere; søger en gæst, skal de andre vente indtil dette interval "
"er passeret. Alle positive heltal er gyldige værdier. Ønsker du at "
"deaktivere tjek af søgeintervaller for gæster, sæt denne værdi til \"0\"."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:633
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Search page system load limit</guilabel>: You can also limit the "
"amount of load your system will undergo for searches. If the system load "
"exceeds this value, your board will go offline and be temporarily disabled. "
"All numbers between 0 and 1.0 (inclusive) are valid values. A value of "
"\"1.0\", for example, represents about 100% utilisation of a single "
"processor; if the system load exceeds this value, the board will go offline."
" Note that this feature only works for *nix-based servers."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Systembelastningsgrænse for søgeside</guilabel>: Du kan også "
"begrænse den mængde belastning, dit system udsættes for ved søgninger. "
"Overstiger systembelastningen denne værdi, går dit board offline og "
"deaktiveres midlertidigt. Alle tal mellem 0 og 1.0 (inklusive) er gyldige "
"værdier. En værdi på \"1.0\" repræsenterer f.eks. ca. 100% udnyttelse af en "
"enkelt processor; overstiger systembelastningen denne værdi, går boardet "
"offline. Bemærk at denne funktion kun virker for *nix-baserede servere."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:634
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Min author name characters</guilabel>: Users have to enter at "
"least this many characters of the name when performing a wildcard author "
"search. If the author's username is shorter than this number, your users can"
" still search for the author's posts by entering the complete username. All "
"positive integers are valid values."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Minimum antal tegn i forfatternavn</guilabel>: Brugere skal "
"indtaste mindst dette antal tegn af navnet, når de udfører en jokertegns-"
"forfattersøgning. Er forfatterens brugernavn kortere end dette tal, kan dine"
" brugere stadig søge efter forfatterens indlæg ved at indtaste det fulde "
"brugernavn. Alle positive heltal er gyldige værdier."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:635
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Search result cache length</guilabel>: phpBB3 can also cache "
"search results. These cached search results will expire after this number of"
" seconds. All positive integers are valid values. Set this value to \"0\" if"
" you want to disable search caching."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Cachetid for søgeresultater</guilabel>: phpBB3 kan også "
"mellemlagre søgeresultater. Disse mellemlagrede søgeresultater udløber efter"
" dette antal sekunder. Alle positive heltal er gyldige værdier. Sæt denne "
"værdi til \"0\", ønsker du at deaktivere mellemlagring af søgninger."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:627
msgid ""
"The first group of search settings are general and user-facing, meaning that"
" they concern the users who use the search functionality directly. "
"<_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Den første gruppe af søgeindstillinger er generelle og brugervendte, hvilket"
" betyder at de vedrører de brugere, der bruger søgefunktionen direkte. "
"<_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:641
msgid "Search Backend"
msgstr "Søgebackend"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:642
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Search backend</guilabel>: This option specifies the backend that "
"your board's search facilities will use if it is enabled. The backend is "
"essentially the system/method that is actually responsible for conducting "
"searches based on the queries it is given. There are four available options:"
" <guimenuitem>MySQL Fulltext</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>phpBB Native "
"Fulltext</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>PostgreSQL Fulltext</guimenuitem>, and "
"<guimenuitem>Sphinx Fulltext</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Søgebackend</guilabel>: Denne indstilling angiver den backend, dit"
" boards søgefaciliteter bruger, hvis den er aktiveret. Backenden er i bund "
"og grund det system/den metode, der faktisk er ansvarlig for at udføre "
"søgninger baseret på de forespørgsler, den modtager. Der er fire "
"tilgængelige muligheder: <guimenuitem>MySQL Fulltext</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>phpBB Native Fulltext</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>PostgreSQL "
"Fulltext</guimenuitem> og <guimenuitem>Sphinx Fulltext</guimenuitem>."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: admin_guide.xml:645
msgid ""
"If you choose to change your board's current search backend, you will have "
"to create an index of your board's content for the new search backend. If "
"you know for sure that you're not going to use the index that was used with "
"your old, previously chosen search backend, you can also delete it in order "
"to free up some of your system's resources. To learn more about maintaining "
"your board's search indices, see <xref linkend=\"acp_maintenance_search\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Vælger du at ændre boardets nuværende søgebackend, skal du oprette et indeks"
" over boardets indhold til den nye søgebackend. Ved du med sikkerhed at du "
"ikke skal bruge det indeks, der blev brugt med din gamle, tidligere valgte "
"søgebackend, kan du også slette det for at frigøre nogle af dit systems "
"ressourcer. For at lære mere om vedligeholdelse af boardets søgeindekser, se"
" <xref linkend=\"acp_maintenance_search\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:639
msgid ""
"The next group of search settings actually only contains one setting: "
"choosing what backend your board's search facilities, if enabled, will use. "
"The following details this option. <_:itemizedlist-1/> <_:note-2/>"
msgstr ""
"Den næste gruppe af søgeindstillinger indeholder faktisk kun én indstilling:"
" valg af hvilken backend dit boards søgefaciliteter, hvis aktiveret, skal "
"bruge. Følgende uddyber denne indstilling. <_:itemizedlist-1/> <_:note-2/>"

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:651
msgid "Fulltext mysql"
msgstr "Fulltext mysql"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:652
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Support for non-latin UTF-8 characters using PCRE</guilabel>: This"
" tells you if your system supports searching for non-Latin "
"<acronym>UTF</acronym>-8 characters. This is only available in "
"<glossterm>PHP</glossterm> versions 4.4 and above, and 5.1 and above. This "
"is only relevant if you actually want your users to have the ability to "
"search for non-Latin characters."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Understøttelse af ikke-latinske UTF-8-tegn med PCRE</guilabel>: "
"Dette fortæller dig om dit system understøtter søgning efter ikke-latinske "
"<acronym>UTF</acronym>-8-tegn. Dette er kun tilgængeligt i "
"<glossterm>PHP</glossterm>-versioner 4.4 og over, samt 5.1 og over. Dette er"
" kun relevant, ønsker du at dine brugere skal have muligheden for at søge "
"efter ikke-latinske tegn."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:653
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Support for non-latin UTF-8 characters using mbstring</guilabel>: "
"If your system doesn't support UTF-8 characters using "
"<acronym>PCRE</acronym> (as indicated in the setting above), the mySQL "
"fulltext search backend will try to use mbstring's regular expression "
"engine. Again, this is only relevant if you actually want your users to have"
" the ability to seasrch for non-Latin characters."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Understøttelse af ikke-latinske UTF-8-tegn med "
"mbstring</guilabel>: Understøtter dit system ikke UTF-8-tegn med "
"<acronym>PCRE</acronym> (som angivet i indstillingen ovenfor), forsøger "
"MySQL fulltext-søgebackenden at bruge mbstrings regulære udtryksmotor. Igen "
"er dette kun relevant, ønsker du at dine brugere skal have muligheden for at"
" søge efter ikke-latinske tegn."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:649
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>MySQL Fulltext</guimenuitem> will make your board use MySQL's "
"fulltext search as its search backend. This causes the SQL server to perform"
" the searches, rather than building our own search tables. The settings "
"shown are informational only and require the server's system administrator "
"for changes to be made. <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>MySQL Fulltext</guimenuitem> får dit board til at bruge MySQL's"
" fulltext-søgning som søgebackend. Dette får SQL-serveren til at udføre "
"søgningerne, i stedet for at opbygge egne søgetabeller. De viste "
"indstillinger er kun informative og kræver serverens systemadministrator for"
" at foretage ændringer. <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:659
msgid "Fulltext native"
msgstr "Fulltext native"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:660
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable fulltext updating</guilabel>: This option allows you to "
"control whether or not your board's search index will update when posts are "
"made. If you would like to enable this, choose <guilabel>Yes</guilabel>. "
"Note that this setting is not relevant if your board's search functionality "
"is disabled entirely."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Aktivér fulltext-opdatering</guilabel>: Denne indstilling giver "
"dig mulighed for at styre om boardets søgeindeks opdateres, når der skrives "
"indlæg. Ønsker du at aktivere dette, vælg <guilabel>Ja</guilabel>. Bemærk at"
" denne indstilling ikke er relevant, hvis boardets søgefunktion er "
"deaktiveret helt."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:661
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Min characters indexed by search</guilabel>: You can also control "
"the minimum number of characters words must contain in order to be included "
"in your board's search index. It is recommended that you not set this too "
"low in order to have a quality search index. All positive integers are valid"
" values."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Min. antal tegn indekseret ved søgning</guilabel>: Du kan også "
"styre det minimale antal tegn, ord skal indeholde for at blive medtaget i "
"boardets søgeindeks. Det anbefales, at du ikke sætter denne for lavt, for at"
" have et kvalitetssøgeindeks. Alle positive heltal er gyldige værdier."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:662
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max characters indexed by search</guilabel>: Just like the above "
"setting, you can also control the maximum number of characters words must "
"contain in order to be included in your board's search index. If a word has "
"more than this number of characters in it, it will not be included in the "
"search index. All positive integers are valid values."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maks. antal tegn indekseret ved søgning</guilabel>: Ligesom "
"ovenstående indstilling kan du også styre det maksimale antal tegn, ord skal"
" indeholde for at blive medtaget i boardets søgeindeks. Har et ord flere "
"tegn end dette tal, medtages det ikke i søgeindekset. Alle positive heltal "
"er gyldige værdier."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:663
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Common word threshold</guilabel>: Like phpBB2's stopwords feature,"
" you can prevent the use of common words that you specify. However, this "
"feature is expanded upon in phpBB3. You can now control the threshold that a"
" word can have; this means that if a word is contained in more than a "
"certain percentage of posts on your board, it will be deemed as a common "
"word, and will be ignored in search queries. All positive integers are valid"
" values, and represent the percentage of posts on your board words can be "
"contained in. If you would like to disable this threshold and thereby allow "
"searches using all words, even if they can be common, set this value to "
"\"0\". This setting only applies if your board has more than 100 posts."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Grænse for almindelige ord</guilabel>: Ligesom phpBB2's "
"stopordsfunktion kan du forhindre brugen af almindelige ord, du selv "
"angiver. Denne funktion er dog udvidet i phpBB3. Du kan nu styre den "
"grænseværdi, et ord kan have; det betyder at hvis et ord forekommer i mere "
"end en bestemt procentdel af indlæggene på dit board, anses det som et "
"almindeligt ord og ignoreres i søgeforespørgsler. Alle positive heltal er "
"gyldige værdier og repræsenterer den procentdel af indlæggene på dit board, "
"ordene kan forekomme i. Ønsker du at deaktivere denne grænseværdi og dermed "
"tillade søgninger med alle ord, selv hvis de kan være almindelige, sæt denne"
" værdi til \"0\". Denne indstilling gælder kun, hvis dit board har mere end "
"100 indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:657
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>phpBB Native Fulltext</guimenuitem> is the default option, "
"which is phpBB's own native fulltext search. <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>phpBB Native Fulltext</guimenuitem> er standardvalget, som er "
"phpBB's egen native fulltext-søgning. <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

