#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:710
msgid "Explanation of forum types"
msgstr "Forklaring af forumtyper"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:711
msgid ""
"In phpBB 3.3, there are three forum types. A forum can be a normal forum "
"where people can post in, a category that contains forums, or it can be a "
"simple link."
msgstr ""
"I phpBB 3.3 findes der tre forumtyper. Et forum kan være et normalt forum, "
"hvor folk kan skrive indlæg, en kategori der indeholder fora, eller det kan "
"være et simpelt link."

