"kategorier."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:741
msgid "Subforums"
msgstr "Underfora"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:742
msgid ""
"One of the features in phpBB 3.3 is <glossterm>subforums</glossterm>. "
"Especially bulletin boards with a high number of forums will benefit from "
"this. In the simple flat category and forum approach in phpBB 2.0, all "
"forums and categories were listed on the forum index. In Proteus you can now"
" put as many forums, links, or categories as you like inside other forums."
msgstr ""
"En af funktionerne i phpBB 3.3 er <glossterm>underfora</glossterm>. Især "
"boards med et stort antal fora vil have gavn af dette. I den simple flade "
"kategori- og forumtilgang i phpBB 2.0 blev alle fora og kategorier vist på "
"forumindekset. I Proteus kan du nu placere lige så mange fora, links eller "
"kategorier, som du ønsker, inde i andre fora."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:744
msgid ""
"If you have a forum about pets for instance, you are able to put subforums "
"for cats, dogs, or guinea pigs inside it without making the parent \"Pets\" "
"forum a category. In this example, only the \"Pets\" forum will be listed on"
" the index like a normal forum. Its subforums will appear as simple links "
"below the forum description (unless you disabled this)."
msgstr ""
"Har du f.eks. et forum om kæledyr, kan du placere underfora til katte, hunde"
" eller marsvin inde i det, uden at gøre det overordnede forum \"Kæledyr\" "
"til en kategori. I dette eksempel vises kun forummet \"Kæledyr\" på "
"indekset, ligesom et normalt forum. Dets underfora vises som simple links "
"under forumbeskrivelsen (medmindre du har deaktiveret dette)."

