#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:961
msgid "Topic icons"
msgstr "Emneikoner"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:963
msgid ""
"A new feature in phpBB3 is the ability to assign icons to topics. On this "
"page, you can manage what topic icons are available for use on your board. "
"You can add, edit, delete, or move topic icons. The <guilabel>Topic "
"Icons</guilabel> form displays the topic icons currently installed on your "
"board. You can add topic icons manually, install a premade icons pack, "
"export or download an icons pack file, or edit your currently installed "
"topic icons."
msgstr ""
"En ny funktion i phpBB3 er muligheden for at tildele ikoner til emner. På "
"denne side kan du administrere hvilke emneikoner der er tilgængelige til "
"brug på dit board. Du kan tilføje, redigere, slette eller flytte emneikoner."
" Formularen <guilabel>Emneikoner</guilabel> viser de emneikoner, der aktuelt"
" er installeret på dit board. Du kan tilføje emneikoner manuelt, installere "
"en færdiglavet ikonpakke, eksportere eller downloade en ikonpakkefil, eller "
"redigere dine aktuelt installerede emneikoner."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:965
msgid ""
"Your first option to add topic icons to your board is to use a premade icons"
" pack. Icon packs have the file extension <filename>pak</filename>. To "
"install an icons pack, you must first download an icons pack. Upload the "
"icon files themselves and the pack file into the "
"<filename>/images/icons/</filename> directory. Then, click <guilabel>Install"
" icons pak</guilabel>. The <guilabel>Install icons pak</guilabel> form "
"displays all of the options you have regarding topic icon installation. "
"Select the icon pack you wish to add (you may only install one icon pack at "
"a time). You then have the option of what to do with currently installed "
"topic icons if the new icon pack has icons that may conflict with them. You "
"can either keep the existing icon(s) (there may be duplicates), replace the "
"matches (overwriting the icon(s) that already exist), or just delete all of "
"the conflicting icons. Once you have selected the proper option, click "
"<guilabel>Install icons pak</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Din første mulighed for at tilføje emneikoner til dit board er at bruge en "
"færdiglavet ikonpakke. Ikonpakker har filendelsen <filename>pak</filename>. "
"For at installere en ikonpakke skal du først downloade en ikonpakke. Upload "
"selve ikonfilerne og pakkefilen til mappen "
"<filename>/images/icons/</filename>. Klik derefter på <guilabel>Installer "
"ikonpakke</guilabel>. Formularen <guilabel>Installer ikonpakke</guilabel> "
"viser alle de muligheder, du har vedrørende installation af emneikoner. Vælg"
" den ikonpakke, du ønsker at tilføje (du kan kun installere én ikonpakke ad "
"gangen). Du har derefter mulighed for at vælge, hvad der skal ske med "
"aktuelt installerede emneikoner, hvis den nye ikonpakke har ikoner, der kan "
"være i konflikt med dem. Du kan enten beholde de eksisterende ikon(er) (der "
"kan være dubletter), erstatte matchene (overskrive de allerede eksisterende "
"ikoner), eller blot slette alle de konfliktende ikoner. Når du har valgt den"
" rette mulighed, klik på <guilabel>Installer ikonpakke</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:967
msgid ""
"To add topic icon(s) manually, you must first upload the icons into the "
"icons directory of your site. Navigate to the <guimenuitem>Topic "
"icons</guimenuitem> page. Click <guilabel>Add multiple icons</guilabel>, "
"which is located in the <guilabel>Topic Icons</guilabel> form. If you "
"correctly uploaded your new desired topic icon(s) into the proper "
"<filename>/images/icons/</filename> directory, you should see a row of "
"settings for each new icon you uploaded. The following has a description on "
"what each field is for. Once you are done with adding the topic icon(s), "
"click, <guilabel>Submit</guilabel> to submit your additions."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje emneikon(er) manuelt, skal du først uploade ikonerne til "
"ikonmappen på dit site. Naviger til siden "
"<guimenuitem>Emneikoner</guimenuitem>. Klik på <guilabel>Tilføj flere "
"ikoner</guilabel>, som findes i formularen <guilabel>Emneikoner</guilabel>. "
"Har du korrekt uploadet dine nye ønskede emneikon(er) til den rette mappe "
"<filename>/images/icons/</filename>, bør du se en række indstillinger for "
"hvert nye ikon, du har uploadet. Følgende beskriver, hvad hvert felt bruges "
"til. Når du er færdig med at tilføje emneikon(erne), klik på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> for at indsende dine tilføjelser."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:970
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Icon image file</guilabel>: This column will display the actual "
"icon itself."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikon-billedfil</guilabel>: Denne kolonne viser selve ikonet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:971
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Icon location</guilabel>: This column will display the path that "
"the icon is located in, relative to the <filename>/images/icons/</filename> "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikonplacering</guilabel>: Denne kolonne viser den sti, ikonet er "
"placeret i, relativt til mappen <filename>/images/icons/</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:972
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Icon width</guilabel>: This is the width (in pixels) you want the "
"icon to be stretched to."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikonbredde</guilabel>: Dette er den bredde (i pixels), du ønsker, "
"ikonet skal strækkes til."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:973
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Icon height</guilabel>: This is the height (in pixels) you want "
"the icon to be stretched to."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikonhøjde</guilabel>: Dette er den højde (i pixels), du ønsker, "
"ikonet skal strækkes til."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:974
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Display on posting</guilabel>: If this checkbox is checked, the "
"topic icon will actually be displayed on the posting screen."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vis ved indlæg</guilabel>: Er dette afkrydsningsfelt markeret, "
"vises emneikonet faktisk på indlægsskærmbilledet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:975
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Icon order</guilabel>: You can also set what order that the topic "
"icon will be displayed. You can either set the topic icon to be the first, "
"or after any other topic icon currently installed."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Ikonrækkefølge</guilabel>: Du kan også angive den rækkefølge, "
"emneikonet vises i. Du kan enten indstille emneikonet til at være det "
"første, eller placeret efter et hvilket som helst andet aktuelt installeret "
"emneikon."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:976
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Add</guilabel>: If you are satisfied with the settings for adding "
"your new topic icon, check this box."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tilføj</guilabel>: Er du tilfreds med indstillingerne for at "
"tilføje dit nye emneikon, markér denne boks."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:979
msgid ""
"You may also edit your currently installed topic icons' settings. To do so, "
"click <guilabel>Edit icons</guilabel>. You will see the <guilabel>Icon "
"configuration</guilabel> form. For more information regarding each field, "
"see the above paragraph regarding adding topic icons."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også redigere indstillingerne for dine aktuelt installerede "
"emneikoner. For at gøre dette, klik på <guilabel>Rediger ikoner</guilabel>. "
"Du vil se formularen <guilabel>Ikonkonfiguration</guilabel>. For mere "
"information om hvert felt, se ovenstående afsnit om tilføjelse af "
"emneikoner."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:981
msgid ""
"Lastly, you may also reorder the topic icons, edit a topic icon's settings, "
"or remove a topic icon. To reorder a topic icon, click the appropriate "
"\"move up\" or \"move down\" icon. To edit a topic icon's current settings, "
"click the \"settings\" button. To delete a topic icon, click the red "
"\"delete\" button."
msgstr ""
"Endelig kan du også omorganisere emneikonerne, redigere et emneikons "
"indstillinger eller fjerne et emneikon. For at omorganisere et emneikon, "
"klik på det tilhørende \"flyt op\"- eller \"flyt ned\"-ikon. For at redigere"
" et emneikons aktuelle indstillinger, klik på \"indstillinger\"-knappen. For"
" at slette et emneikon, klik på den røde \"slet\"-knap."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:992
msgid "Smilies"
msgstr "Smileys"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:994
msgid ""
"Smilies or emoticons are typically small, sometimes animated images used to "
"convey an emotion or feeling. You can manage the smilies on your board via "
"this page. To add smilies, you have the option to either install a premade "
"smilies pack, or add smilies manually. Locate the "
"<guilabel>Smilies</guilabel> form, which lists the smilies currently "
"installed on your board, on the page."
