"om hvert felt, se ovenstående afsnit om tilføjelse af smileys."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1014
msgid ""
"Lastly, you may also reorder the smilies, edit a smiley's settings, or "
"remove a smiley. To reorder a smiley, click the appropriate \"move up\" or "
"\"move down\" icon. To edit a smiley's current settings, click the "
