msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimal filstørrelse</guilabel>: Den maksimale filstørrelse for "
"en tilladt vedhæftet fil. Ønsker du denne værdi ubegrænset, brug en værdi på"
" 0."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1054
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Maximum filesize messaging</guilabel>: The maximum drive space "
"that will be available per user for attachments posted in private messages. "
"If you want this quota to be unlimited, use a value of 0."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimal filstørrelse for beskeder</guilabel>: Den maksimale "
"diskplads, der er tilgængelig pr. bruger for vedhæftede filer postet i "
"private beskeder. Ønsker du denne kvote ubegrænset, brug en værdi på 0."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1055
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max attachments per post</guilabel>: The maximum number of "
"attachments that can be posted in a post. If you want this value to be "
"unlimited, use a value of 0."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maks. antal vedhæftede filer pr. indlæg</guilabel>: Det maksimale "
"antal vedhæftede filer, der kan postes i et indlæg. Ønsker du denne værdi "
"ubegrænset, brug en værdi på 0."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1056
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Max attachments per message</guilabel>: The maximum number of "
"attachments that can be posted in a private message. If you want this value "
"to be unlimited, use a value of 0."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maks. antal vedhæftede filer pr. besked</guilabel>: Det maksimale "
"antal vedhæftede filer, der kan postes i en privat besked. Ønsker du denne "
"værdi ubegrænset, brug en værdi på 0."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1057
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Enable secure downloads</guilabel>: If you want to be able to only"
" allow attachments to be available to specific <glossterm>IP "
"address</glossterm>es or hostnames, this option should be enabled. You can "
"further configure secure downloads once you have enabled them here; the "
"secure downloads-specific settings are located in the <guilabel>Define "
"allowed IPs/Hostnames</guilabel> and <guilabel>Remove or un-exclude allowed "
"IPs/hostnames</guilabel> forms at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Aktivér sikre downloads</guilabel>: Ønsker du kun at tillade "
"vedhæftede filer tilgængelige for bestemte <glossterm>IP-"
"adresser</glossterm> eller værtsnavne, bør denne indstilling aktiveres. Du "
"kan yderligere konfigurere sikre downloads, når du har aktiveret dem her; de"
" sikre downloads-specifikke indstillinger findes i formularerne "
"<guilabel>Definér tilladte IP'er/værtsnavne</guilabel> og <guilabel>Fjern "
"eller inkludér tilladte IP'er/værtsnavne</guilabel> nederst på siden."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1058
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allow/Deny list</guilabel>: This allows you to configure the "
"default behaviour when secure downloads are enabled. A whitelist "
"(<guilabel>Allow</guilabel>) only allows <glossterm>IP address</glossterm>es"
" or hostnames to access downloads, while a blacklist "
"(<guilabel>Deny</guilabel>) allows all users except those who have an "
"<glossterm>IP address</glossterm> or hostname located on the blacklist. "
"<emphasis>This setting only applies if secure downloads are "
"enabled.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tillad-/afvis-liste</guilabel>: Dette giver dig mulighed for at "
"konfigurere standardopførslen, når sikre downloads er aktiveret. En "
"hvidliste (<guilabel>Tillad</guilabel>) giver kun <glossterm>IP-"
"adresser</glossterm> eller værtsnavne adgang til downloads, mens en "
"sortliste (<guilabel>Afvis</guilabel>) tillader alle brugere undtagen dem "
"med en <glossterm>IP-adresse</glossterm> eller et værtsnavn på sortlisten. "
"<emphasis>Denne indstilling gælder kun, hvis sikre downloads er "
"aktiveret.</emphasis>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1059
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allow empty referrer</guilabel>: Secure downloads are based on "
"referrers.This setting controls if downloads are allowed for those omitting "
"the referrer information. <emphasis>This setting only applies if secure "
"downloads are enabled.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tillad tom referrer</guilabel>: Sikre downloads er baseret på "
"referrere. Denne indstilling styrer om downloads tillades for dem, der "
"udelader referrer-oplysningerne. <emphasis>Denne indstilling gælder kun, "
"hvis sikre downloads er aktiveret.</emphasis>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1060
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Check attachment files</guilabel>: Some browsers can be tricked to"
" assume an incorrect mimetype for uploaded files. This option ensures that "
"such files likely to cause this are rejected. <emphasis>It is recommended "
"that you leave this setting enabled.</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tjek vedhæftede filer</guilabel>: Nogle browsere kan narres til at"
" antage en forkert mimetype for uploadede filer. Denne indstilling sikrer, "
"at sådanne filer, som sandsynligvis vil forårsage dette, afvises. "
"<emphasis>Det anbefales, at du lader denne indstilling forblive "
"aktiveret.</emphasis>"

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1064
msgid "Image Category Settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for billedkategori"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1065
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Display images inline</guilabel>: How image attachments are "
"displayed. If this is set to <guilabel>No</guilabel>, a link to the "
"attachment will be given instead, rather than the image itself (or a "
"thumbnail) being displayed inline."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Vis billeder i teksten</guilabel>: Hvordan vedhæftede billeder "
"vises. Er denne sat til <guilabel>Nej</guilabel>, gives der i stedet et link"
" til den vedhæftede fil, i stedet for at selve billedet (eller et "
"miniaturebillede) vises i teksten."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1066
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Create thumbnail</guilabel>: This setting configures your board to"
" either create a thumbnail for every image attached, or not."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Opret miniaturebillede</guilabel>: Denne indstilling konfigurerer "
"dit board til enten at oprette et miniaturebillede for hvert vedhæftet "
"billede, eller ej."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1067
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Maximum thumbnail width in pixels</guilabel>: This is the maximum "
"width in pixels for the created thumbnails."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimal bredde for miniaturebillede i pixels</guilabel>: Dette er"
" den maksimale bredde i pixels for de oprettede miniaturebilleder."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1068
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Maximum thumbnail filesize</guilabel>: Thumbnails will not be "
"created for images if the created thumbnail filesize exceeds this value, in "
"bytes. This is useful for particularly large images that are posted."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimal filstørrelse for miniaturebillede</guilabel>: "
"Miniaturebilleder oprettes ikke for billeder, hvis det oprettede "
"miniaturebilledes filstørrelse overstiger denne værdi, i bytes. Dette er "
"nyttigt for særligt store billeder, der postes."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1069
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Maximum image dimensions</guilabel>: The maximum size of image "
"attachments, in pixels. If you would like to disable dimension checking (and"
" thereby allow image attachments of any dimensions), set each value to 0."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimale billeddimensioner</guilabel>: Den maksimale størrelse på"
" vedhæftede billeder, i pixels. Ønsker du at deaktivere dimensionstjek (og "
"dermed tillade vedhæftede billeder af enhver størrelse), sæt hver værdi til "
"0."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1070
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Image link dimensions</guilabel>: If an image attachment is larger"
" than these dimensions (in pixels), a link to the image will be displayed in"
" the post instead. If you want images to be displayed inline regardless of "
"dimensions, set each value to 0."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Billedlinkdimensioner</guilabel>: Er et vedhæftet billede større "
"end disse dimensioner (i pixels), vises der i stedet et link til billedet i "
"indlægget. Ønsker du at billeder altid skal vises i teksten uanset "
"dimensioner, sæt hver værdi til 0."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1074
msgid "Define Allowed/Disallowed IPs/Hostnames"
msgstr "Definér tilladte/ikke-tilladte IP'er/værtsnavne"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1075
msgid ""
"<guilabel>IP addresses or hostnames</guilabel>: If you have secure downloads"
" enabled, you can specify the <glossterm>IP address</glossterm>es or "
"hostnames allowed or disallowed. If you specify more than one <glossterm>IP "
"address</glossterm> or hostname, each <glossterm>IP address</glossterm> or "
"hostname should be on its own line. Entered values can have wildcards (*). "
"To specify a range for an <glossterm>IP address</glossterm>, separate the "
"start and end with a hyphen (-)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>IP-adresser eller værtsnavne</guilabel>: Har du sikre downloads "
"aktiveret, kan du angive de tilladte eller ikke-tilladte <glossterm>IP-"
"adresser</glossterm> eller værtsnavne. Angiver du mere end én <glossterm>IP-"
"adresse</glossterm> eller værtsnavn, bør hver <glossterm>IP-"
"adresse</glossterm> eller værtsnavn stå på sin egen linje. Angivne værdier "
"kan have jokertegn (*). For at angive et interval for en <glossterm>IP-"
"adresse</glossterm>, adskil start og slut med en bindestreg (-)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1076
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Exclude IP from [dis]allowed IPs/hostnames</guilabel>: Enable this"
" to exclude the entered IP(s)/hostname(s)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Undtag IP fra [ikke-]tilladte IP'er/værtsnavne</guilabel>: Aktivér"
" dette for at undtage de angivne IP(er)/værtsnavn(e)."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1088
msgid "Manage extensions"
msgstr "Administrer filendelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1090
msgid ""
"You can further configure your board's attachments settings by controlling "
"what file extensions attached files can have to be uploaded. It is "
"recommended that you do not allow scripting file extensions (such as php, "
"php3, php4, phtml, pl, cgi, py, rb, asp, aspx, and so forth) for security "
"reasons. You can find this page by clicking <guimenuitem>Manage "
"extensions</guimenuitem> once you're in the <glossterm>ACP</glossterm>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan yderligere konfigurere boardets indstillinger for vedhæftede filer "
"ved at styre hvilke filendelser vedhæftede filer kan have for at blive "
"uploadet. Det anbefales, at du af sikkerhedshensyn ikke tillader "
"scriptingfilendelser (såsom php, php3, php4, phtml, pl, cgi, py, rb, asp, "
"aspx osv.). Du finder denne side ved at klikke på <guimenuitem>Administrer "
"filendelser</guimenuitem>, når du er i <glossterm>ACP</glossterm>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1092
msgid ""
"To add an allowed file extension, find the <guilabel>Add "
"Extension</guilabel> form on the page. In the field labeled "
"<guilabel>Extension</guilabel>, type in the file extension. Do not include "
"the period before the file extension. Then, select the extension group that "
"this new file extension should be added to via the <guilabel>Extension "
"group</guilabel> selection menu. Then, click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en tilladt filendelse, find formularen <guilabel>Tilføj "
"filendelse</guilabel> på siden. I feltet mærket "
"<guilabel>Filendelse</guilabel>, indtast filendelsen. Inkludér ikke "
"punktummet før filendelsen. Vælg derefter den extension-gruppe, denne nye "
"filendelse skal tilføjes til, via dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Extension-"
"gruppe</guilabel>. Klik derefter på <guilabel>Send</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1094
msgid ""
"You can also view your board's current allowed file extensions. On the page,"
" you should see a table listing all of the allowed file extensions. To "
"change the group that an extension belongs to, select a new extension group "
"from the selection menu located in the extension's row. To delete an "
"extension, check the checkbox in the <guilabel>Delete</guilabel> column. "
"When you're done managing your board's current file extensions, click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel> at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også se boardets aktuelt tilladte filendelser. På siden bør du se en "
"tabel, der viser alle de tilladte filendelser. For at ændre hvilken gruppe "
"en filendelse tilhører, vælg en ny extension-gruppe fra dropdownmenuen "
"placeret i filendelsens række. For at slette en filendelse, markér "
"afkrydsningsfeltet i kolonnen <guilabel>Slet</guilabel>. Når du er færdig "
"med at administrere boardets aktuelle filendelser, klik på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> nederst på siden."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1105
msgid "Manage extension groups"
msgstr "Administrer grupper af filendelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1107
msgid ""
"Allowed file extensions can be placed into groups for easy management and "
"viewing. To manage the extension groups, click <guimenuitem>Manage extension"
" groups</guimenuitem> once you get into the <guilabel>Posting</guilabel> "
"settings part of the <glossterm>ACP</glossterm>. You can configure specific "
"settings regarding each extension group."
msgstr ""
"Tilladte filendelser kan placeres i grupper for nem administration og "
"oversigt. For at administrere extension-grupperne, klik på "
"<guimenuitem>Administrer grupper af filendelser</guimenuitem>, når du er "
"kommet ind i sektionen <guilabel>Indlæg</guilabel> i "
"<glossterm>ACP</glossterm>. Du kan konfigurere specifikke indstillinger for "
"hver extension-gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1109
msgid ""
"To add a new file extension group, find the textbox that corresponds to the "
"<guilabel>Create new group</guilabel> button. Type in the name of the "
"extension group, then click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>. You will be greeted"
" with the extension group settings form. The following contains descriptions"
" for each option available, and applies to extension groups that either "
"already exist or are being added."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en ny gruppe af filendelser, find tekstfeltet, der svarer til"
" knappen <guilabel>Opret ny gruppe</guilabel>. Indtast navnet på extension-"
"gruppen, klik derefter på <guilabel>Send</guilabel>. Du mødes med formularen"
" for extension-gruppens indstillinger. Følgende indeholder beskrivelser for "
"hver tilgængelig indstilling, og gælder for extension-grupper, der enten "
"allerede findes eller tilføjes."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1112
msgid "Add Extension Group"
msgstr "Tilføj extension-gruppe"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1113
msgid "<guilabel>Group name</guilabel>: The name of the extension group."
msgstr "<guilabel>Gruppenavn</guilabel>: Navnet på extension-gruppen."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1114
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Special category</guilabel>: Files in this extension group can be "
"displayed differently. Select a special category from this selection menu to"
" change the way the attachments in this extension group is presented within "
"a post."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Speciel kategori</guilabel>: Filer i denne extension-gruppe kan "
"vises forskelligt. Vælg en speciel kategori fra denne dropdownmenu for at "
"ændre den måde, vedhæftede filer i denne extension-gruppe præsenteres på i "
"et indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1115
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allowed</guilabel>: Enable this if you want to allow attachments "
"that belong in this extension group."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tilladt</guilabel>: Aktivér dette, ønsker du at tillade vedhæftede"
" filer, der hører til denne extension-gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1116
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allowed in private messaging</guilabel>: Enable this if you want "
"to allow attachments that belong in this extension group in private "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tilladt i private beskeder</guilabel>: Aktivér dette, ønsker du at"
" tillade vedhæftede filer, der hører til denne extension-gruppe, i private "
"beskeder."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1117
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Upload icon</guilabel>: The small icon that is displayed next to "
"all attachments that belong in this extension group."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Uploadikon</guilabel>: Det lille ikon, der vises ved siden af alle"
" vedhæftede filer, der hører til denne extension-gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1118
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Maximum filesize</guilabel>: The maximum filesize for attachments "
"in this extension group."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Maksimal filstørrelse</guilabel>: Den maksimale filstørrelse for "
"vedhæftede filer i denne extension-gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1119
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Assigned extensions</guilabel>: This is a list of all file "
"extensions that belong in this extension group. Click <guilabel>Go to "
"extension management screen</guilabel> to manage what extensions belong in "
"this extension group."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tildelte filendelser</guilabel>: Dette er en liste over alle "
"filendelser, der hører til denne extension-gruppe. Klik på <guilabel>Gå til "
"modulet for administration af filendelser</guilabel> for at administrere "
"hvilke filendelser, der hører til denne extension-gruppe."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1120
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Allowed forums</guilabel>: This allows you to control what forums "
"your users are allowed to post attachments that belong in this extension "
"group. To enable this extension group in all forums, select the "
"<guilabel>Allow all forums</guilabel> radio button. To set which specific "
"forums this extension group is allowed in, select the <guilabel>Only forums "
"selected below</guilabel> radio button, and then select the forums in the "
"selection menu."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Tilladte fora</guilabel>: Dette giver dig mulighed for at styre i "
"hvilke fora dine brugere må poste vedhæftede filer, der hører til denne "
"extension-gruppe. For at aktivere denne extension-gruppe i alle fora, vælg "
"radioknappen <guilabel>Tillad alle fora</guilabel>. For at angive hvilke "
"specifikke fora denne extension-gruppe er tilladt i, vælg radioknappen "
"<guilabel>Kun fora valgt nedenfor</guilabel>, og vælg derefter foraene i "
"dropdownmenuen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1123
msgid ""
"To edit a current file extension group's settings, click the \"Settings\" "
"icon that is in the extension group's row. Then, go ahead and edit the "
"extension group's settings. For more information about each setting, see the"
" above."
msgstr ""
"For at redigere en aktuel gruppe af filendelsers indstillinger, klik på "
"\"indstillinger\"-ikonet i extension-gruppens række. Rediger derefter "
"extension-gruppens indstillinger. For mere information om hver indstilling, "
"se ovenstående."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1125
msgid ""
"To delete an extension group, click the \"Delete\" icon that is in the "
"extension group's row."
msgstr ""
"For at slette en extension-gruppe, klik på \"slet\"-ikonet i extension-"
"gruppens række."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1136
msgid "Orphaned attachments"
msgstr "Forældreløse vedhæftede filer"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1138
msgid ""
"Sometimes, attachments may be orphaned, which means that they exist in the "
"specified files directory (to configure this directory, see the section on "
"<link linkend=\"acp_attach_settings\">attachment settings</link>), but "
"aren't assigned to any post(s). This can happen when posts are deleted or "
"edited, or even when users attach a file, but don't submit their post."
msgstr ""
"Nogle gange kan vedhæftede filer blive forældreløse, hvilket betyder at de "
"findes i den angivne filmappe (for at konfigurere denne mappe, se afsnittet "
"om <link linkend=\"acp_attach_settings\">indstillinger for vedhæftede "
"filer</link>), men ikke er tilknyttet noget indlæg. Dette kan ske, når "
"indlæg slettes eller redigeres, eller endda når brugere vedhæfter en fil, "
"men ikke indsender deres indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1140
msgid ""
"To manage orphaned attachments, click on <guimenuitem>Orphaned "
"attachments</guimenuitem> on the left-hand menu once you're in the "
"<guimenuitem>Posting</guimenuitem> settings section of the "
"<glossterm>ACP</glossterm>. You should see a list of all orphaned "
"attachments in the table, along with all the important information regarding"
" each orphaned attachment."
msgstr ""
"For at administrere forældreløse vedhæftede filer, klik på "
"<guimenuitem>Forældreløse vedhæftede filer</guimenuitem> i venstre menu, når"
" du er i sektionen <guimenuitem>Indlæg</guimenuitem> i "
"<glossterm>ACP</glossterm>. Du bør se en liste over alle forældreløse "
"vedhæftede filer i tabellen, sammen med alle de vigtige oplysninger om hver "
"forældreløs vedhæftet fil."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1142
msgid ""
"You can assign an orphaned attachment to a specific post. To do so, you must"
" first find the post's post ID. Enter this value into the <guilabel>Post "
"ID</guilabel> column for the particular orphaned attachment. Enable "
"<guilabel>Attach file to post</guilabel>, then click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan tildele en forældreløs vedhæftet fil til et bestemt indlæg. For at "
"gøre dette skal du først finde indlæggets indlægs-ID. Indtast denne værdi i "
"kolonnen <guilabel>Indlægs-ID</guilabel> for den pågældende forældreløse "
"vedhæftede fil. Aktivér <guilabel>Vedhæft fil til indlæg</guilabel>, klik "
"derefter på <guilabel>Send</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1144
msgid ""
"To delete an orphaned attachment, check the orphaned attachment's "
"<guilabel>Delete</guilabel> checkbox, then click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel>. Note that this cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"For at slette en forældreløs vedhæftet fil, markér den forældreløse "
"vedhæftede fils afkrydsningsfelt <guilabel>Slet</guilabel>, klik derefter på"
" <guilabel>Send</guilabel>. Bemærk at dette ikke kan fortrydes."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1160
msgid "Users Management"
msgstr "Brugeradministration"

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1163
msgid "Manage Users"
msgstr "Administrer brugere"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1164
msgid ""
"Users are the basis of your forum. As a forum administrator, it is very "
"important to be able to manage your users. Managing your users and their "
"information and specific options is easy, and can be done via the "
"<acronym>ACP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Brugere er grundlaget for dit forum. Som forumadministrator er det meget "
"vigtigt at kunne administrere dine brugere. At administrere dine brugere og "
"deres oplysninger samt specifikke indstillinger er nemt og kan gøres via "
"<acronym>ACP</acronym>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1166
msgid ""
"To begin, log in and reach your <acronym>ACP</acronym>. Find and click on "
"<guimenuitem>Users and Groups</guimenuitem> to reach the necessary page. If "
"you do not see <guimenuitem>User Administration</guimenuitem> , simply find "
"and click on <guimenuitem>Manage Users</guimenuitem> in the navigation menu "
"on the left side of the page."
msgstr ""
"Log ind og gå til din <acronym>ACP</acronym> for at begynde. Find og klik på"
" <guimenuitem>Brugere og grupper</guimenuitem> for at komme til den "
"nødvendige side. Ser du ikke "
"<guimenuitem>Brugeradministration</guimenuitem>, find og klik blot på "
"<guimenuitem>Administrer brugere</guimenuitem> i navigationsmenuen i venstre"
" side af siden."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1168
msgid ""
"To continue and manage a user, you must know the username(s) that you want "
"to manage. In the textbox for the <guilabel>\"Find a member:\"</guilabel> "
"field, type in the username of the user whose information and settings you "
"wish to manage. On the other hand, if you want to find a member, click on "
"<guilabel>[ Find a Member ]</guilabel> (which is below the textbox) and "
"follow all the steps appropriate to find and select a user. If you wiant to "
"manage the information and settings for the Anonymous user (any visitor who "
"is not logged in is set as the Anonymous user), check the checkbox labeled "
"<guilabel>\"Select Anonymous User\"</guilabel>. Once you have selected a "
"user, click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"For at fortsætte og administrere en bruger, skal du kende det/de "
"brugernavn(e), du ønsker at administrere. I tekstfeltet for feltet "
"<guilabel>\"Find et medlem:\"</guilabel>, indtast brugernavnet på den "
"bruger, hvis oplysninger og indstillinger du ønsker at administrere. Vil du "
"derimod finde et medlem, klik på <guilabel>[ Find et medlem ]</guilabel> "
"(som findes under tekstfeltet), og følg de nødvendige trin for at finde og "
"vælge en bruger. Ønsker du at administrere oplysninger og indstillinger for "
"den anonyme bruger (enhver besøgende, der ikke er logget ind, angives som "
"den anonyme bruger), markér afkrydsningsfeltet mærket <guilabel>\"Vælg "
"anonym bruger\"</guilabel>. Når du har valgt en bruger, klik på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1170
msgid ""
"There are many sections relating to a user's settings. The following are "
"subsections that have more information on each form. Each form allows you to"
" manage specific settings for the user you have selected. When you are done "
"with editing the data on each form, click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel> "
"(located at the bottom of each form) to submit your changes."
msgstr ""
"Der er mange sektioner relateret til en brugers indstillinger. Følgende er "
"undersektioner med flere oplysninger om hver formular. Hver formular giver "
"dig mulighed for at administrere specifikke indstillinger for den bruger, du"
" har valgt. Når du er færdig med at redigere data på hver formular, klik på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> (placeret nederst på hver formular) for at "
"indsende dine ændringer."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1180
msgid "User Overview"
msgstr "Brugeroversigt"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1181
msgid ""
"This is the first form that shows up when you first select a user to manage."
" Here, all of the general information and settings for each user is "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den første formular, der vises, når du første gang vælger en bruger"
" at administrere. Her vises alle de generelle oplysninger og indstillinger "
"for hver bruger."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1185
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Brugernavn"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1187
msgid ""
"This is the name of the user you're currently managing. If you want to "
"change the user's username, type in a new username between three and twenty "
"characters long into the textbox labeled <guilabel>Username:</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Dette er navnet på den bruger, du aktuelt administrerer. Ønsker du at ændre "
"brugerens brugernavn, indtast et nyt brugernavn mellem tre og tyve tegn "
"langt i tekstfeltet mærket <guilabel>Brugernavn:</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1192
msgid "Registered"
msgstr "Tilmeldt"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1194
msgid ""
"This is the complete date on which the user registered. You cannot edit this"
" value."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den fulde dato, brugeren tilmeldte sig. Du kan ikke redigere denne "
"værdi."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1199
msgid "Registered from IP"
msgstr "Tilmeldt fra IP"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1201
msgid ""
"This is the <acronym>IP</acronym> address from which the user registered his"
" or her account. If you want to determine the <acronym>IP</acronym> "
"hostname, click on the <acronym>IP</acronym> address itself. The current "
"page will reload and will display the appropriate information. If you want "
"to perform a whois on the <acronym>IP</acronym> address, click on the "
"<guilabel>Whois</guilabel> link. A new window will pop up with this data."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den <acronym>IP</acronym>-adresse, brugeren tilmeldte sin konto "
"fra. Ønsker du at bestemme <acronym>IP</acronym>-værtsnavnet, klik på selve "
"IP-adressen. Den aktuelle side genindlæses og viser de relevante "
"oplysninger. Ønsker du at foretage et whois-opslag på "
"<acronym>IP</acronym>-adressen, klik på linket <guilabel>Whois</guilabel>. "
"Et nyt vindue åbnes med disse data."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1206
msgid "Last Active"
msgstr "Senest aktiv"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1208
msgid "This is the complete date on which the user was last active."
msgstr "Dette er den fulde dato, brugeren senest var aktiv."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1213
msgid "Posts"
msgstr "Indlæg"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1215
msgid "This number indicates how many posts the user has posted on the board."
msgstr "Dette tal angiver, hvor mange indlæg brugeren har skrevet på boardet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1222
msgid "This is the number of warnings the user currently has."
msgstr "Dette er antallet af advarsler, brugeren aktuelt har."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1223
msgid "For more information about warnings, see <xref linkend=\"mcp_warnings\"/>."
msgstr "For mere information om advarsler, se <xref linkend=\"mcp_warnings\"/>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1228
msgid "Founder"
msgstr "Grundlægger"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1230
msgid ""
"Founders are users who have all administrator permissions and can never be "
"banned, deleted or altered by non-founder members. If you want to set this "
"user as a founder, select the <guilabel>Yes</guilabel> radio button. To "
"remove founder status from a user, select the <guilabel>No</guilabel> radio "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Grundlæggere er brugere, der har alle administratortilladelser, og som "
"aldrig kan udelukkes, slettes eller ændres af medlemmer, der ikke er "
"grundlæggere. Ønsker du at gøre denne bruger til grundlægger, vælg "
"radioknappen <guilabel>Ja</guilabel>. For at fjerne grundlæggerstatus fra en"
" bruger, vælg radioknappen <guilabel>Nej</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1235
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mail"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1237
msgid ""
"This is the user's currently set email address. To change the email address,"
" fill in the <guilabel>Email:</guilabel> textbox with a valid email."
msgstr ""
"Dette er brugerens aktuelt angivne e-mailadresse. For at ændre "
"e-mailadressen, udfyld tekstfeltet <guilabel>E-mail:</guilabel> med en "
"gyldig e-mail."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1242
msgid "Confirm email address"
msgstr "Bekræft e-mailadresse"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1244
msgid ""
"This textbox should only be filled if you are changing the user's email "
"address. If you are changing the email address, both the "
"<guilabel>Email:</guilabel> textbox and this one should be filled with the "
"same email address. If you do not fill this in, the user's email address "
"will not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Dette tekstfelt bør kun udfyldes, hvis du ændrer brugerens e-mailadresse. "
"Ændrer du e-mailadressen, bør både tekstfeltet <guilabel>E-mail:</guilabel> "
"og dette felt udfyldes med samme e-mailadresse. Udfylder du ikke dette, "
"ændres brugerens e-mailadresse ikke."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1249
msgid "New password"
msgstr "Ny adgangskode"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1251
msgid ""
"As an administrator, you cannot see any of your users' password. However, it"
" is possible to change passwords. To change the user's password, type in a "
"new password in the <guilabel>New password:</guilabel> textbox. The new "
"password has to be between six and thirty characters long."
msgstr ""
"Som administrator kan du ikke se nogen af dine brugeres adgangskoder. Det er"
" dog muligt at ændre adgangskoder. For at ændre brugerens adgangskode, "
"indtast en ny adgangskode i tekstfeltet <guilabel>Ny "
"adgangskode:</guilabel>. Den nye adgangskode skal være mellem seks og "
"tredive tegn lang."

#. (itstool) path: important/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1253
msgid ""
"Before submitting any changes to the user, make sure this field is blank, "
"unless you really want to change the user's password. If you accidentally "
"change the user's password, the original password cannot be recovered!"
msgstr ""
"Før du indsender nogen ændringer til brugeren, sørg for at dette felt er "
"tomt, medmindre du virkelig ønsker at ændre brugerens adgangskode. Ændrer du"
" ved et uheld brugerens adgangskode, kan den oprindelige adgangskode ikke "
"gendannes!"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1258
msgid "Confirm new password"
msgstr "Bekræft ny adgangskode"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1260
msgid ""
"This textbox should only be filled if you are changing the user's password. "
"If you are changing the user's password, the <guilabel>Confirm new "
"password:</guilabel> textbox needs to be filled in with the same password "
"you filled in in the above <guilabel>New password:</guilabel> textbox."
msgstr ""
"Dette tekstfelt bør kun udfyldes, hvis du ændrer brugerens adgangskode. "
"Ændrer du brugerens adgangskode, skal tekstfeltet <guilabel>Bekræft ny "
"adgangskode:</guilabel> udfyldes med den samme adgangskode, du udfyldte i "
"ovenstående tekstfelt <guilabel>Ny adgangskode:</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1265
msgid "Quick Tools"
msgstr "Hurtige værktøjer"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1267
msgid ""
"The options in the <guilabel>Quick Tools</guilabel> drop-down selection box "
"allow you to quickly and easily change one of the user's options. The "
"available options are <guilabel>Delete Signature</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Delete Avatar</guilabel>, <guilabel>Move all Posts</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Delete all Posts</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Delete all "
"attachments</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Mulighederne i dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Hurtige værktøjer</guilabel> giver "
