"tilgængelige muligheder er <guilabel>Slet signatur</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Slet avatar</guilabel>, <guilabel>Flyt alle indlæg</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Slet alle indlæg</guilabel> og <guilabel>Slet alle vedhæftede "
"filer</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1281
msgid "User Feedback"
msgstr "Brugerfeedback"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1282
msgid ""
"Another aspect of managing a user is editing their feedback data. Feedback "
"consists of any sort of user warning issued to the user by a forum "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Et andet aspekt af at administrere en bruger er at redigere dennes "
"feedbackdata. Feedback består af enhver form for brugeradvarsel, udstedt til"
" brugeren af en forumadministrator."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1284
msgid ""
"To customise the display of the user's existing log entries, select any "
"criteria for your customisation by selecting your options in the drop-down "
"selection boxes entitled <guilabel>Display entries from previous:</guilabel>"
" and <guilabel>Sort by:</guilabel>. <guilabel>Display entries from "
"previous:</guilabel> allows you to set a specific time period in which the "
"feedback was issued. <guilabel>Sort by:</guilabel> allows you to sort the "
"existing log entries by <guimenuitem>Username</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Date</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>IP address</guimenuitem>, and "
"<guimenuitem>Log Action</guimenuitem>. The log entries can then be sorted in"
" ascending or descending order. When you are done setting these options, "
"click the <guilabel>Go</guilabel> button to update the page with your "
"customisations."
msgstr ""
"For at tilpasse visningen af brugerens eksisterende logposter, vælg "
"eventuelle kriterier for din tilpasning ved at vælge dine indstillinger i "
"dropdownmenuerne <guilabel>Vis poster fra de foregående:</guilabel> og "
"<guilabel>Sortér efter:</guilabel>. <guilabel>Vis poster fra de "
"foregående:</guilabel> giver dig mulighed for at angive en bestemt "
"tidsperiode, feedbacken blev udstedt i. <guilabel>Sortér efter:</guilabel> "
"giver dig mulighed for at sortere de eksisterende logposter efter "
"<guimenuitem>Brugernavn</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Dato</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>IP-adresse</guimenuitem> og "
"<guimenuitem>Loghandling</guimenuitem>. Logposterne kan derefter sorteres i "
"stigende eller faldende rækkefølge. Når du er færdig med at angive disse "
"indstillinger, klik på knappen <guilabel>Gå</guilabel> for at opdatere siden"
" med dine tilpasninger."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1286
msgid ""
"Another way of managing a user's feedback data is by adding feedback. Simply"
" find the section entitled <guilabel>Add feedback</guilabel> and enter your "
"message into the <guilabel>FEEDBACK</guilabel> text area. When you are done,"
