"avatar image."
msgstr ""
"Her kan du administrere brugerens <glossterm>avatar</glossterm>. Har "
"brugeren allerede angivet en avatar for sig selv, kan du se avatarbilledet."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1339
msgid ""
"Depending on your avatar settings (for more information on avatar settings, "
"see <link linkend=\"acp_board_avatars\">Avatar Settings</link>), you can "
