#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1478
msgid "Users' permissions"
msgstr "Brugertilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1479
msgid ""
"Along with being able to manage users' information, it is also important to "
"be able to regularly maintain and control permissions for the users on your "
"board. User permissions include capabilities such as the use of avatars and "
"sending private messages. Global moderator permissions includings abilities "
"such as approving posts, managing topics, and managing bans. Lastly "
"administrator permissions such as altering permissions, defining custom "
"BBCodes, and managing forums."
msgstr ""
"Ud over at kunne administrere brugeres oplysninger er det også vigtigt at "
"kunne jævnligt vedligeholde og styre tilladelser for brugerne på dit board. "
"Brugertilladelser omfatter kapaciteter såsom brug af avatarer og afsendelse "
"af private beskeder. Globale redaktørtilladelser omfatter blandt andet "
"muligheder som godkendelse af indlæg, administration af emner og "
"administration af udelukkelser. Endelig administratortilladelser såsom "
"ændring af tilladelser, definering af brugerdefinerede BBkoder og "
"administration af fora."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1481
msgid ""
"To start managing a user's permissions, locate the <guimenuitem>Users and "
"Groups</guimenuitem> tab and click on <guimenuitem>Users' "
"Permissions</guimenuitem> in the left-side navigation menu. Here, you can "
"assign global permissions to users. In the <guilabel>Look Up "
"User</guilabel>. In the <guilabel>Find a user</guilabel> field, type in the "
"username of the user whose permissions you want to edit. (If you want to "
"edit the anonymous user, check the <guilabel>Select anonymous "
"user</guilabel> checkbox.) Click <guilabel>Submit</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"For at begynde at administrere en brugers tilladelser, find fanen "
"<guimenuitem>Brugere og grupper</guimenuitem>, og klik på "
"<guimenuitem>Brugertilladelser</guimenuitem> i navigationsmenuen i venstre "
"side. Her kan du tildele globale tilladelser til brugere. I feltet "
"<guilabel>Find en bruger</guilabel>, indtast brugernavnet på den bruger, "
"hvis tilladelser du ønsker at redigere. (Ønsker du at redigere den anonyme "
"bruger, markér afkrydsningsfeltet <guilabel>Vælg anonym bruger</guilabel>.) "
"Klik på <guilabel>Send</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1483
msgid ""
"Permissions are grouped into three different categories: user, moderator, "
"and admin. Each user can have specific settings in each permission category."
" To faciliate user permissions editing, it is possible to assign specific "
"preset roles to the user."
msgstr ""
"Tilladelser er grupperet i tre forskellige kategorier: bruger, redaktør og "
"administrator. Hver bruger kan have specifikke indstillinger i hver "
"tilladelseskategori. For at lette redigeringen af brugertilladelser er det "
"muligt at tildele specifikke foruddefinerede roller til brugeren."

#. (itstool) path: important/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1486
msgid ""
"For the following permissions editing actions that are described, there are "
"three choices you have to choose from. You may either select "
"<guilabel>Yes</guilabel>, <guilabel>No</guilabel>, or "
"<guilabel>Never</guilabel>. Selecting <guilabel>Yes</guilabel> will enable "
"the selected permission for the user, while selecting "
"<guilabel>No</guilabel> will disallow the user from having permission for "
"the selected setting, <emphasis>unless another permission setting from "
"another area overrides the setting</emphasis>. If you want to completely "
"disallow the user from having the selected permission "
"<emphasis>ever</emphasis>, then select <guilabel>Never</guilabel>. The "
"<guilabel>Never</guilabel> setting will override all other values assigned "
"to the setting."
msgstr ""
"For de følgende beskrevne handlinger til redigering af tilladelser skal du "
"vælge mellem tre muligheder. Du kan enten vælge <guilabel>Ja</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Nej</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel>. Vælges "
"<guilabel>Ja</guilabel>, aktiveres den valgte tilladelse for brugeren, mens "
"valg af <guilabel>Nej</guilabel> forhindrer brugeren i at have tilladelse "
"til den valgte indstilling, <emphasis>medmindre en anden "
"tilladelsesindstilling fra et andet område tilsidesætter "
"indstillingen</emphasis>. Ønsker du helt at forhindre brugeren i nogensinde "
"at have den valgte tilladelse, vælg <guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel>. "
"Indstillingen <guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel> tilsidesætter alle andre værdier "
"tildelt indstillingen."

