#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1504
msgid "Users' forum permissions"
msgstr "Brugeres forumtilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1506
msgid ""
"Along with editing your users' user account-related permissions, you can "
"also edit their forum permissions, which relate to the forums in your board."
" Forum permissions are different from user permissions in that they are "
"directly related and tied to the forums. <guimenuitem>Users' forum "
"permissions</guimenuitem> allows you to edit your users' forum permissions. "
"When doing so, you can only assign forum permissions to one user at a time."
msgstr ""
"Ud over at redigere dine brugeres brugerkontorelaterede tilladelser, kan du "
"også redigere deres forumtilladelser, som relaterer sig til foraene på dit "
"board. Forumtilladelser adskiller sig fra brugertilladelser ved, at de er "
"direkte relateret til og knyttet til foraene. <guimenuitem>Brugeres "
"forumtilladelser</guimenuitem> giver dig mulighed for at redigere dine "
"brugeres forumtilladelser. Når du gør dette, kan du kun tildele "
"forumtilladelser til én bruger ad gangen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1508
msgid ""
"To start editing a user's forum permissions, start by typing in the user's "
"username into the <guilabel>Find a member</guilabel> text box. If you would "
"like to edit the forum permissions that pertain to the anonymous user, check"
" the <guilabel>Select anonymous user</guilabel> text box. Click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel> to continue."
msgstr ""
"For at begynde at redigere en brugers forumtilladelser, begynd med at "
"indtaste brugerens brugernavn i tekstfeltet <guilabel>Find et "
"medlem</guilabel>. Ønsker du at redigere de forumtilladelser, der vedrører "
"den anonyme bruger, markér tekstfeltet <guilabel>Vælg anonym "
"bruger</guilabel>. Klik på <guilabel>Send</guilabel> for at fortsætte."

