#. (itstool) path: caption/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1517
msgid ""
"Selecting forums to assign forum permissions to users. In this example, the "
"\"Cats\" and \"Dogs\" subforums (their parent forum is \"Pets\") are "
"selected. The user's forum permissions for these two forums will be "
"edited/updated."
msgstr ""
"Valg af fora til at tildele forumtilladelser til brugere. I dette eksempel "
"er underforaene \"Katte\" og \"Hunde\" (deres overordnede forum er "
"\"Kæledyr\") valgt. Brugerens forumtilladelser for disse to fora "
"redigeres/opdateres."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1522
msgid ""
"You should now be able to assign forum permissions to the user. You now have"
" two ways to assign forum permissions to the user: you may either select the"
" forum(s) manually with a multiple selection menu, or select a specific "
"forum or category, along with its associated subforums. Click "
"<guilabel>Submit</guilabel> to continue with the forum(s) you have picked. "
"Now, you should be greeted with the <guilabel>Setting permissions</guilabel>"
" screen, where you can actually assign the forum permissions to the user. "
"You should now select what kind of forum permissions you want to edit now; "
"you may either edit the user's <guimenuitem>Forum permissions</guimenuitem> "
"or <guimenuitem>Moderator permissions</guimenuitem>. Click "
"<guilabel>Go</guilabel>. You should now be able to select the role to assign"
" to the user for each forum you selected previously. If you would like to "
"configure these permissions with more detail, click the <guilabel>Advanced "
"permissions</guilabel> link located in the appropriate forum permissions "
"box, and then update the permissions accordingly. When you are done, click "
"<guilabel>Apply all permissions</guilabel> if you are in the "
"<guilabel>Advanced permissions</guilabel> area, or click <guilabel>Apply all"
" permissions</guilabel> at the bottom of the page to submit all of your "
"changes on the page."
msgstr ""
"Du bør nu kunne tildele forumtilladelser til brugeren. Du har nu to måder at"
" tildele forumtilladelser til brugeren på: du kan enten vælge "
"forummet/forummene manuelt med en flervalgsmenu, eller vælge et bestemt "
"forum eller kategori, sammen med dets tilhørende underfora. Klik på "
"<guilabel>Send</guilabel> for at fortsætte med det/de forum(-er), du har "
"valgt. Du bør nu mødes med skærmbilledet <guilabel>Indstil "
"tilladelser</guilabel>, hvor du faktisk kan tildele forumtilladelserne til "
"brugeren. Du bør nu vælge hvilken slags forumtilladelser du vil redigere nu;"
" du kan enten redigere brugerens <guimenuitem>Forumtilladelser</guimenuitem>"
" eller <guimenuitem>Redaktørtilladelser</guimenuitem>. Klik på "
"<guilabel>Gå</guilabel>. Du bør nu kunne vælge den rolle, der skal tildeles "
"brugeren for hvert forum, du tidligere valgte. Ønsker du at konfigurere "
"disse tilladelser mere detaljeret, klik på linket <guilabel>Avancerede "
"tilladelser</guilabel>, placeret i det relevante felt for forumtilladelser, "
"og opdater derefter tilladelserne tilsvarende. Når du er færdig, klik på "
"<guilabel>Anvend alle tilladelser</guilabel>, hvis du er i området "
"<guilabel>Avancerede tilladelser</guilabel>, eller klik på <guilabel>Anvend "
"alle tilladelser</guilabel> nederst på siden for at indsende alle dine "
"ændringer på siden."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1533
msgid "Custom profile fields"
msgstr "Brugerdefinerede profilfelter"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1535
msgid ""
"One of the many new features in phpBB3 that enhance the user experience is "
"<guilabel>Custom Profile Fields</guilabel>. In the past, users could only "
"fill in information in the common profile fields that were displayed; "
"administrators had to add MODifications to their board to accommodate their "
"individual needs. In phpBB3, however, administrators can comfortably create "
"custom profile fields through the <acronym>ACP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"En af de mange nye funktioner i phpBB3, der forbedrer brugeroplevelsen, er "
"<guilabel>Brugerdefinerede profilfelter</guilabel>. Tidligere kunne brugere "
"kun udfylde oplysninger i de almindelige profilfelter, der blev vist; "
"administratorer måtte tilføje MODifikationer til deres board for at "
"imødekomme deres individuelle behov. I phpBB3 kan administratorer dog "
"komfortabelt oprette brugerdefinerede profilfelter via "
"<acronym>ACP</acronym>."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1539
msgid "Add profile field"
msgstr "Tilføj profilfelt"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1540
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Field type:</guilabel> This is the kind of the field that your new"
" custom profile field is. That means that it can consist of numbers, dates, "
"etc. This should already be set."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Felttype:</guilabel> Dette er den slags felt, dit nye "
"brugerdefinerede profilfelt er. Det betyder, at det kan bestå af tal, datoer"
" osv. Dette bør allerede være angivet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1541
msgid ""
