"på alle de e-mails, du ønsker at vælge. Slip CTRL-tasten, når du er færdig."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1623
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Email address</guilabel>: This multiple selection menu lists all "
"currently banned emails. Select the email that you want to un-ban or exclude"
