"linkend=\"ucp_preferences\">afsnittet om brugerindstillinger</link> for mere"
" information om indstillinger for private beskeder."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:1852
msgid "Group colour"
msgstr "Gruppefarve"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1853
msgid ""
"The name of members that have this group as their default group (see <xref "
"linkend=\"acp_groups_default\"/>) will be displayed in this colour on all "
"forum pages. If you enable <link "
"linkend=\"acp_groups_edit_legend\"><guilabel>Display group in "
