#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1927
msgid "Global Permissions"
msgstr "Globale tilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1928
msgid ""
"These affect the whole board and are not bound to specific forums. They "
"include user permissions, which limit the use of the UCP, searching, private"
" messaging, using of avatars/signatures/etc. Administrator permissions are "
"also set here, as they are Global."
msgstr ""
"Disse påvirker hele boardet og er ikke bundet til specifikke fora. De "
"omfatter brugertilladelser, som begrænser brugen af "
"<acronym>UCP</acronym>'en, søgning, private beskeder, brug af "
"avatarer/signaturer m.m. Administratortilladelser indstilles også her, da de"
" er globale."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1931 admin_guide.xml:2100
msgid "Global User Permissions"
msgstr "Globale brugertilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1932
msgid ""
"Global User permissions are those permissions which apply to all forums, "
"such as permissions to attach or download files or use a signature, or "
"permissions which are unrelated to a forum, such as permissions relating to "
"profiles, private messages, and email."
msgstr ""
"Globale brugertilladelser er de tilladelser, som gælder for alle fora, såsom"
" tilladelse til at vedhæfte eller downloade filer eller bruge en signatur, "
"eller tilladelser der slet ikke er knyttet til et forum, såsom tilladelser "
"vedrørende profiler, private beskeder og e-mail."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1934
msgid ""
"Although Global User permissions can be assigned to users by click "
"<guilabel>Users’ Permissions</guilabel> from your ACP Permissions tab, "
"selecting a user, and then selecting <guilabel>User permissions</guilabel> "
"from the <guilabel>Select type</guilabel> dropdown, it is generally far "
"preferable to avoid using User permissions and use Group permissions "
"instead. This will make it easier to manage permissions in the future and to"
" assign permissions to users in the future. The only practical difference "
"between User permissions and Group permissions is that User permissions "
"require you to set permissions for each user individually, where Group "
"permission let you create a Group and assign its members a set of "
"permissions. Then, if you wish other users to have the same permissions, you"
" can just add them to the Group."
msgstr ""
"Selvom globale brugertilladelser kan tildeles brugere ved at klikke på "
"<guilabel>Brugertilladelser</guilabel> under fanen Tilladelser i ACP, vælge "
"en bruger og derefter vælge <guilabel>Brugertilladelser</guilabel> i "
"dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Vælg type</guilabel>, er det generelt langt at "
"foretrække at undgå brugertilladelser og i stedet bruge gruppetilladelser. "
"Det gør det lettere at administrere tilladelser fremover og at tildele "
"tilladelser til brugere senere. Den eneste praktiske forskel mellem bruger- "
"og gruppetilladelser er, at brugertilladelser kræver, at du indstiller "
"tilladelser for hver bruger individuelt, mens gruppetilladelser lader dig "
"oprette en gruppe og tildele dens medlemmer et sæt tilladelser. Ønsker du "
"herefter at give andre brugere de samme tilladelser, kan du blot tilføje dem"
" til gruppen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1936
msgid ""
"Global user permissions can be assigned to user groups by clicking "
"<guilabel>Groups’ permissions</guilabel> from your ACP Permissions tab, "
"selecting a user group, and then selecting <guilabel>User "
"permissions</guilabel> from the <guilabel>Select type</guilabel> dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Globale brugertilladelser kan tildeles brugergrupper ved at klikke på "
"<guilabel>Gruppetilladelser</guilabel> under fanen Tilladelser i ACP, vælge "
"en brugergruppe og derefter vælge <guilabel>Brugertilladelser</guilabel> i "
"dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Vælg type</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1938
msgid ""
"In either case, you will be allowed to select a stock User Role in the "
"dropdown, or you can click <guilabel>Advanced Permissions</guilabel> to "
"customise the permissions. However, the better way to customise one of the "
"stock Roles is to create a new User role based on the settings of an "
"existing Role. You can alse create a new User role from scratch. Roles use "
"fewer resource than if you make modifications by editing the Advanced "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"I begge tilfælde kan du vælge en standard brugerrolle i dropdownmenuen, "
"eller du kan klikke på <guilabel>Avancerede tilladelser</guilabel> for at "
"tilpasse tilladelserne. Den bedste måde at tilpasse en af standardrollerne "
"på er dog at oprette en ny brugerrolle baseret på indstillingerne for en "
"eksisterende rolle. Du kan også oprette en helt ny brugerrolle fra bunden. "
"Roller bruger færre ressourcer, end hvis du foretager ændringer ved at "
"redigere de avancerede tilladelser."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:1941 admin_guide.xml:2091
msgid "Global Moderator Permissions"
msgstr "Globale redaktørtilladelser"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1942
msgid ""
"Global Moderator permissions are those permissions which apply to editing, "
"deleting, or otherwise affecting other users’ topics and posts, or to affect"
" other users through reports, warnings, or bans. Permissions given here will"
" apply to any forum the user or user group can see."
msgstr ""
"Globale redaktørtilladelser er de tilladelser, som gælder for redigering, "
"sletning eller på anden vis påvirkning af andre brugeres emner og indlæg, "
"eller for at påvirke andre brugere gennem anmeldelser, advarsler eller "
"udelukkelser. Tilladelser, der gives her, gælder for ethvert forum, som "
"brugeren eller brugergruppen kan se."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:1944
msgid ""
"Global Moderator permissions can be assigned to users by clicking "
