#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2005
msgid "There are four types of Permission Roles: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr "Der findes fire typer tilladelsesroller: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2014
msgid ""
"Permission Roles can be maintained by clicking the corresponding link on the"
" ACP Permissions tab. Roles provide a convenient permissions template to use"
" when assigning permissions to either users or user groups. A Role’s "
"permissions settings can be viewed or edited by clicking the green-gear for "
"that role."
msgstr ""
"Tilladelsesroller kan vedligeholdes ved at klikke på det tilsvarende link "
"under fanen Tilladelser i ACP. Roller giver en praktisk tilladelsesskabelon,"
" som kan bruges, når du tildeler tilladelser til brugere eller "
"brugergrupper. En rolles tilladelsesindstillinger kan ses eller redigeres "
"ved at klikke på det grønne tandhjul for den pågældende rolle."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2016
msgid ""
"Most standard Roles use combinations of <guilabel>Yes</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>No</guilabel>, meaning that if one user is assigned two different "
"roles from being a member of two different groups, for instance Limited "
"Access and Regular Access, the <guilabel>Yes</guilabel>es will override the "
"<guilabel>No</guilabel>s and leave the user with Regular Access."
msgstr ""
"De fleste standardroller bruger kombinationer af <guilabel>Ja</guilabel> og "
"<guilabel>Nej</guilabel>. Det betyder, at hvis en bruger får tildelt to "
"forskellige roller ved at være medlem af to forskellige grupper - for "
"eksempel Begrænset adgang og Almindelig adgang - vil et "
"<guilabel>Ja</guilabel> have forrang for et <guilabel>Nej</guilabel>, "
"hvilket giver brugeren Almindelig adgang."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2018
msgid ""
"The Exceptions are the ones with <guilabel>Never</guilabel> settings, such "
"as the User Roles <guilabel>No Avatar</guilabel> , <guilabel>No "
"PMs</guilabel> and <guilabel>Newly Registered User Features</guilabel>, and "
"the Forum Role <guilabel>On Moderation Queue</guilabel>. These four Roles "
"use <guilabel>Never</guilabel> settings, and therefore override the "
"<guilabel>Yes</guilabel> settings that would have been granted by other "
"roles."
msgstr ""
"Undtagelserne er dem med <guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel>-indstillinger, såsom "
"brugerrollerne <guilabel>Ingen avatar</guilabel>, <guilabel>Ingen private "
"beskeder</guilabel> og <guilabel>Nyligt registrerede brugeres "
"funktioner</guilabel>, samt forumrollen <guilabel>I "
"moderationskø</guilabel>. Disse fire roller bruger "
"<guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel>-indstillinger og tilsidesætter derfor de "
"<guilabel>Ja</guilabel>-indstillinger, der ellers ville være givet af andre "
"roller."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2020
msgid ""
"You should never use one of these four roles, or any other "
"<guilabel>Never</guilabel> settings with your Registered Users group. Doing "
"so will take those permissions away from everyone, including yourself."
msgstr ""
"Du bør aldrig bruge en af disse fire roller, eller andre "
"<guilabel>Aldrig</guilabel>-indstillinger, på din gruppe af registrerede "
"brugere. Gør du det, fratages alle - dig selv inklusive - disse tilladelser."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2022
msgid ""
"If a Role’s permission settings are not quite right for your forum -- for "
"instance, you don’t want anyone to be able to hide their online status -- "
"you can add or subtract a permission to or from a standard Role. Then "
"wherever that role is used, that permission will be changed."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en rolles tilladelsesindstillinger ikke helt passer til dit forum - "
"hvis du for eksempel ikke ønsker, at nogen skal kunne skjule deres "
"onlinestatus - kan du tilføje eller fjerne en tilladelse fra en "
"standardrolle. Ændringen slår derefter igennem alle steder, hvor rollen "
"bruges."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2024
msgid ""
"You can also create your own custom roles by typing a new name into the "
"<guilabel>Create role</guilabel> box, selecting a role to copy from in the "
"<guilabel>Use settings from</guilabel> dropdown, and click submit. Then you "
"can customise your new role and use it for assigning those permissions."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også oprette dine egne brugerdefinerede roller ved at indtaste et nyt"
" navn i feltet <guilabel>Opret rolle</guilabel>, vælge en rolle at kopiere "
"fra i dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Brug indstillinger fra</guilabel> og klikke "
"på send. Derefter kan du tilpasse din nye rolle og bruge den til at tildele "
"disse tilladelser."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2026
msgid ""
"Using such custom roles is simpler than editing the advanced permissions for"
" multiple forums and should reduce the resources required by your forum when"
" checking permissions."
msgstr ""
"At bruge sådanne brugerdefinerede roller er enklere end at redigere de "
"avancerede tilladelser for flere fora hver for sig, og det bør reducere de "
"ressourcer, dit forum bruger ved tjek af tilladelser."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#. (itstool) path: figure/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2029 admin_guide.xml:2048
msgid "Permission Masks"
msgstr "Tilladelsesmasker"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2030
msgid ""
"In this section, you do not set or change anything, but you can view the "
"final permissions a user or group has based on the combined result of the "
"permissions a user has from his user permissions or group memberships. This "
"feature is particularly useful when you need to debug your permissions and "
"for example, you cannot find out why someone doesn’t have the permission you"
" want him to have. Permission masks is a tool for viewing the permission "
"settings for all five permissions types for both users and user groups."
msgstr ""
"I dette afsnit indstiller eller ændrer du ikke noget, men du kan se de "
"endelige tilladelser, en bruger eller gruppe har, baseret på det samlede "
"resultat af de tilladelser, brugeren har fra sine brugertilladelser eller "
"gruppemedlemskaber. Denne funktion er særligt nyttig, når du skal fejlfinde "
"dine tilladelser, og du f.eks. ikke kan finde ud af, hvorfor nogen ikke har "
"den tilladelse, du ønsker de skal have. Tilladelsesmasker er et værktøj til "
"at se tilladelsesindstillingerne for alle fem tilladelsestyper for både "
"brugere og brugergrupper."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2034
msgid ""
"View administrative permissions for <guilabel>Global Administrator "
"permissions</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Se administrative tilladelser for <guilabel>Globale "
"administratortilladelser</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2035
msgid ""
"View user-based permissions for <guilabel>Global User permissions</guilabel>"
