#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2080
msgid "The following permissions can be set to help start a new forum."
msgstr ""
"Følgende tilladelser kan indstilles for at hjælpe med at starte et nyt "
"forum."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2085
msgid ""
"By default the Administrators user group has the Standard Admin role. This "
"will prevent anyone but the Founder from assigning any other Administrators,"
" editing Roles, and installing any language packs, styles or modules into "
"your forum."
msgstr ""
"Som standard har brugergruppen Administratorer rollen Standardadministrator."
" Dette forhindrer alle undtagen grundlæggeren i at tildele andre "
"administratorer, redigere roller og installere sprogpakker, typografier "
"eller moduler på dit forum."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2086
msgid ""
"By default the Standard Admin Role cannot use other’s permissions. This "
"makes maintaining permissions more difficult, so I would recommend editing "
"the <guilabel>Standard Admin</guilabel> Admin role and adding the permission"
" <guilabel>Can use others permissions</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Som standard kan rollen Standardadministrator ikke bruge andres tilladelser."
" Dette gør vedligeholdelse af tilladelser vanskeligere, så det anbefales at "
"redigere administratorrollen <guilabel>Standardadministrator</guilabel> og "
"tilføje tilladelsen <guilabel>Kan bruge andres tilladelser</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2094
msgid ""
"By default the Global Moderators user group has the Standard Moderator role."
" This allows them to moderate any forum they can see, but does not allow "
"them to change a post's author or ban users."
msgstr ""
"Som standard har brugergruppen Globale redaktører rollen Standardredaktør. "
"Dette giver dem mulighed for at redigere ethvert forum, de kan se, men "
"tillader dem ikke at ændre et indlægs forfatter eller udelukke brugere."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2095
msgid ""
"Add the <guilabel>Standard Moderator</guilabel> or <guilabel>Full Moderator "
"Role</guilabel> to the Administrators user group. This will allow your "
"Administrators to moderate any forum, without having to add them to the "
"Global Moderators user group."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj rollen <guilabel>Standardredaktør</guilabel> eller "
"<guilabel>Fuldgyldig redaktør</guilabel> til brugergruppen Administratorer. "
"Dette giver dine administratorer mulighed for at redigere ethvert forum uden"
" at skulle tilføjes til brugergruppen Globale redaktører."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2103
msgid ""
"Administrators and Global Moderators user groups start with All Features "
"User role, which is fine."
msgstr ""
"Brugergrupperne Administratorer og Globale redaktører starter med rollen "
"Alle funktioner, hvilket er fint."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2104
msgid ""
"Registered Users start with Standard Features User role, which gives them "
"most normal user rights, but does not allow them to change their username or"
