#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2437
msgid "Search Indexing"
msgstr "Søgeindeksering"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2438
msgid ""
"phpBB 3.3 provides you with a powerful search system which can be used to "
"search throughout your board. The main controls for the search features are "
"located in the <link linkend=\"acp_server_search\">Search settings</link> "
"section. Here you can manage the <guilabel>search index</guilabel>, which is"
" used to hold the data necessary for quick and precise search results, it's "
"something like an giant table of contents. By default, two search backends "
"are available - fulltext native, which is included in the phpBB code and "
"works on all <glossterm>DBMS</glossterm>s, and fulltext mysql, which uses "
"the built-in MySQL fulltext searching feature. The first one offers more "
"flexible configuration, while the second one doesn't take too much space in "
"the database and the index is created much faster."
msgstr ""
"phpBB 3.3 giver dig et kraftfuldt søgesystem, som kan bruges til at søge "
"gennem hele dit board. De vigtigste kontroller for søgefunktionerne findes i"
" sektionen <link linkend=\"acp_server_search\">Søgeindstillinger</link>. Her"
" kan du administrere <guilabel>søgeindekset</guilabel>, som bruges til at "
"gemme de data, der er nødvendige for hurtige og præcise søgeresultater - det"
" er noget i retning af en kæmpe indholdsfortegnelse. Som standard er to "
"søgebackends tilgængelige - fulltext native, som er inkluderet i phpBB-koden"
" og virker på alle <glossterm>DBMS</glossterm>'er, og fulltext mysql, som "
"bruger MySQL's indbyggede fulltext-søgefunktion. Den første tilbyder mere "
"fleksibel konfiguration, mens den anden ikke fylder for meget i databasen, "
"og indekset oprettes meget hurtigere."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2440
msgid ""
"Creating a search index can take a very long time, a new window will pop up "
"and refresh itself while creating the necessary search table entries. Please"
" be patient, the process can take several hours on large boards."
msgstr ""
"Oprettelse af et søgeindeks kan tage meget lang tid; et nyt vindue åbnes og "
"opdateres selv, mens de nødvendige søgetabelposter oprettes. Vær venligst "
"tålmodig, processen kan tage flere timer på store boards."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2442
msgid ""
"The fulltext native backend works like this: it uses two tables, one "
"containing the words, which are used on the board and which have a numeric "
"ID assigned and a second table, which links post IDs to word IDs. This "
"system is very fast when you need to search a specific word(s) in the whole "
"database, the following statistics, which are offered on the Search Index "
"page, describe how many words and relations the system holds:"
msgstr ""
"Fulltext native-backenden fungerer sådan: den bruger to tabeller, én der "
"indeholder ordene brugt på boardet, hvor hvert ord har et numerisk ID "
"tildelt, og en anden tabel, der forbinder indlægs-ID'er til ord-ID'er. Dette"
" system er meget hurtigt, når du skal søge efter bestemte ord i hele "
"databasen. Følgende statistikker, som tilbydes på siden Søgeindeks, "
"beskriver hvor mange ord og relationer systemet indeholder:"

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:2445
msgid "<guilabel>Total number of indexed words</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Samlet antal indekserede ord</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2447
msgid ""
"This setting is quite self-explanatory, it is the number of different words "
"that have ever been posted to your board. Only words that match the criteria"
" for indexing, set in the <link linkend=\"acp_server_search\">Search "
"settings</link>, are considered."
msgstr ""
"Denne indstilling forklarer stort set sig selv; det er antallet af "
"forskellige ord, der nogensinde er blevet postet på dit board. Kun ord, der "
"matcher kriterierne for indeksering, angivet i <link "
"linkend=\"acp_server_search\">Søgeindstillinger</link>, medtages."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:2451
msgid "<guilabel>Total number of word to post relations indexed</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Samlet antal indekserede ord-til-indlæg-relationer</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2453
msgid ""
"As described above, the second search table holds a list of relations "
"between the posts and words. For example if someone would post \"airplane\" "
"in two different posts, the system would add the word once and it would add "
"to relations, one to each post."
msgstr ""
"Som beskrevet ovenfor indeholder den anden søgetabel en liste over "
"relationer mellem indlæg og ord. Poster nogen f.eks. ordet \"fly\" i to "
"forskellige indlæg, tilføjer systemet ordet én gang, og tilføjer to "
"relationer, én til hvert indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: admin_guide.xml:2457
msgid "<guilabel>Total number of indexed posts</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>Samlet antal indekserede indlæg</guilabel>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2459
msgid ""
"This statistic is shown for the mysql fulltext backend, where the search is "
"done by a internal mechanism of the Database system. It tells you how many "
"posts on the board were indexed."
msgstr ""
"Denne statistik vises for mysql fulltext-backenden, hvor søgningen udføres "
"af en intern mekanisme i databasesystemet. Den fortæller dig, hvor mange "
"indlæg på boardet der er indekseret."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2477
msgid "System Configuration"
msgstr "Systemkonfiguration"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2478
msgid ""
"Controls which affect the whole board and which are a key part of "
"configuring and running phpBB are located in the System section. Most of "
"these settings require more attention from the administrator and are not so "
"easy to configure, fortunately you will probably not be changing them too "
"often. This includes keeping your installation up-to-date, managing the "
"board's languages or editing the structure of phpBB's control panels."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller, der påvirker hele boardet, og som er en central del af at "
"konfigurere og drive phpBB, findes i sektionen System. De fleste af disse "
"indstillinger kræver mere opmærksomhed fra administratoren og er ikke helt "
"lige så nemme at konfigurere; heldigvis vil du sandsynligvis ikke skulle "
"ændre dem for ofte. Dette omfatter at holde din installation opdateret, "
"administrere boardets sprog eller redigere strukturen for phpBB's "
"kontrolpaneler."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2487
msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Tjek for opdateringer"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2488
msgid ""
"The phpBB 3.3.x branch is usually updated every couple of months as "
"necessary. Bugfixes, new features and other changes are included in these "
"updates. The minor version number gets incremented each time. It is strongly"
" recommended keeping your phpBB installation up to date. Updating from older"
" versions is more difficult, and you will have a hard time finding solutions"
" to possible conflicts. You should use the Full Package Update to update "
"your board, especially if your board does not have any modifications to core"
" files. Alternatively expert users may want to update with the Advanced "
"Update Package, which is able to merge modifications to core files."
msgstr ""
"phpBB 3.3.x-grenen opdateres som regel hver anden måned efter behov. "
"Fejlrettelser, nye funktioner og andre ændringer inkluderes i disse "
"opdateringer. Det mindre versionsnummer øges hver gang. Det anbefales "
"kraftigt at holde din phpBB-installation opdateret. Opdatering fra ældre "
"versioner er mere besværligt, og du vil have svært ved at finde løsninger på"
" eventuelle konflikter. Du bør bruge den fulde pakkeopdatering til at "
"opdatere dit board, især hvis dit board ikke har nogen ændringer i "
"kernefilerne. Alternativt kan erfarne brugere ønske at opdatere med den "
"avancerede opdateringspakke, som kan sammenlægge ændringer i kernefiler."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2489
msgid ""
"You will be notified in your ACP if a new version is released, you will also"
" have a link to the newest release announcement, which will brief you on the"
" added features and the overall changelog."
msgstr ""
"Du bliver underrettet i din ACP, hvis en ny version udgives; du vil også "
"have et link til den nyeste udgivelsesmeddelelse, som briefer dig om de "
"tilføjede funktioner og den samlede ændringslog."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2490
msgid ""
"Updating with the Full Package is very simple. First, you will go to the "
"linked phpBB.com downloads page and download the full package of the latest "
"version. You will extract the contents on your PC, remove config.php, the "
"images/, files/, and store/ directory from the extracted package, and upload"
" them to the root directory of your board, overwriting any old files and "
"merging directories. The board will be offline for normal users for the "
"moment. Then simply go to the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">install/</filename> directory and select the "
"<guilabel>Update</guilabel> tab, continue with updating your board by "
"clicking on \"Update database only\"."
msgstr ""
"Det er meget enkelt at opdatere med den fulde pakke. Først går du til den "
"linkede downloadside på phpBB.com og downloader den fulde pakke af den "
"nyeste version. Du udpakker indholdet på din pc, fjerner config.php samt "
"mapperne images/, files/ og store/ fra den udpakkede pakke, og uploader dem "
"til boardets rodmappe, hvor du overskriver eventuelle gamle filer og "
"sammenlægger mapper. Boardet vil være offline for almindelige brugere i "
"mellemtiden. Gå derefter blot til mappen <filename "
"class=\"directory\">install/</filename>, vælg fanen "
"<guilabel>Opdater</guilabel>, og fortsæt med at opdatere dit board ved at "
"klikke på \"Opdater kun database\"."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2491
msgid ""
"Please have a look at the more detailed instructions for the <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/docs/en/3.3/ug/upgradeguide/update_full/\">Full"
" Package Update</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"Se venligst de mere detaljerede instruktioner for <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.phpbb.com/support/docs/en/3.3/ug/upgradeguide/update_full/\">fuld"
" pakkeopdatering</ulink>"

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2501
msgid "Managing Search Robots"
msgstr "Administration af søgerobotter"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2502
msgid ""
"phpBB 3 introduced a new system for managing search indexer and bot "
"accounts. It allows you to identify these automated bots by their IP or a "
"part of their user-agent, which is a setting that normally identifies the "
"browser of a user. After you add a bot and it is recognized, phpBB does not "
"treat the session as anonymous, but uses the created bot account. Bots use "
"permissions set by the predefined Bots group. Identifying bots is important "
"so that phpBB can serve them content which is more appropriate for search "
"engines - dead links to pages without content are omitted, e.g. posting "
"pages, report post pages etc. Bots never receive a session ID in the URL, "
"which should not appear in the search results. You can also assign a "
"specific style and language to bots."
msgstr ""
"phpBB 3 introducerede et nyt system til administration af søgeindekserings- "
"og botkonti. Det giver dig mulighed for at identificere disse automatiske "
"bots ud fra deres IP eller en del af deres user-agent, hvilket er en "
"indstilling, der normalt identificerer brugerens browser. Efter du har "
"tilføjet en bot, og den genkendes, behandler phpBB ikke sessionen som "
"anonym, men bruger den oprettede botkonto. Bots bruger tilladelser angivet "
"af den foruddefinerede Bots-gruppe. Identifikation af bots er vigtig, så "
"phpBB kan levere indhold til dem, der er mere passende for søgemaskiner - "
"døde links til sider uden indhold udelades, f.eks. sider til indlæg, "
"rapportering af indlæg osv. Bots modtager aldrig et session-ID i URL'en, som"
" ikke bør fremgå i søgeresultaterne. Du kan også tildele bots en bestemt "
"typografi og et bestemt sprog."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2503
msgid ""
"You can easily track if a specific search indexer visited your site recently"
" by checking the <guilabel>Last Visit</guilabel> column on the botlist page."
msgstr ""
"Du kan nemt følge med i, om en bestemt søgeindekserer har besøgt dit site "
"for nylig, ved at tjekke kolonnen <guilabel>Sidste besøg</guilabel> på "
"botlistesiden."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2505
msgid ""
"Bots do not use permissions from the Guest group, but permissions from the "
"Bots group. For more about predefined groups, please read <xref "
"linkend=\"acp_groups_types\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Bots bruger ikke tilladelser fra gæstegruppen, men tilladelser fra Bots-"
"gruppen. For mere om foruddefinerede grupper, læs venligst <xref "
"linkend=\"acp_groups_types\"/>"

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2508
msgid "Adding a bot"
msgstr "Tilføjelse af en bot"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2509
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bot name</guilabel>: This is the title of the bot that will be "
"used on the forum. You will see it in the list of bots in the "
"<acronym>ACP</acronym> and in the Who is Online lists."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Botnavn</guilabel>: Dette er titlen på den bot, der bruges på "
"forummet. Du ser den i listen over bots i <acronym>ACP</acronym> og i "
"listerne Hvem er online."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2510
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bot style</guilabel>: You can select the style served to the bot "
"from the list of installed styles on the board."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bottypografi</guilabel>: Du kan vælge den typografi, der vises til"
" botten, fra listen over installerede typografier på boardet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2511
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bot language</guilabel>: You can do the same with the language. "
"The bot will use the language selected here."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Botsprog</guilabel>: Du kan gøre det samme med sproget. Botten "
"bruger det sprog, der er valgt her."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2512
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bot active</guilabel>: The bot session will be created only if a "
"bot is active, if not, the data for a bot set in this form will not be used "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bot aktiv</guilabel>: Botsessionen oprettes kun, hvis en bot er "
"aktiv; er den ikke, bruges de data for en bot, der er angivet i denne "
"formular, ikke nogen steder."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2513
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Agent match</guilabel>: You can match a bot by either its user-"
"agent or its IP. You can specify a part of the user-agent to be looked for. "
"For example, the Google search indexer has \"Googlebot\" in its user-agent, "
"so you would enter it here to identify when Google crawls your board."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>User-agent-match</guilabel>: Du kan matche en bot enten via dens "
"user-agent eller dens IP. Du kan angive en del af user-agenten, der skal "
"søges efter. Google-søgeindeksereren har f.eks. \"Googlebot\" i sin user-"
"agent, så du skal indtaste dette her for at identificere, når Google "
"gennemsøger dit board."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2514
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Bot IP address</guilabel>: This field is also used to identify the"
" bot. If a bot cannot be recognized by the user-agent, you can specify what "
"<glossterm>IP address</glossterm> should be used to identify it. Partial "
"matches are allowed, that means you can include only the first two or three "
"octets of the IP if the rest dynamically changes. You can also enter "
"multiple IPs separated by a comma."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Bottens IP-adresse</guilabel>: Dette felt bruges også til at "
"identificere botten. Kan en bot ikke genkendes ud fra user-agenten, kan du "
"angive hvilken <glossterm>IP-adresse</glossterm> der skal bruges til at "
"identificere den. Delvise matches er tilladt, hvilket betyder at du kan "
"angive kun de første to eller tre oktetter af IP'en, hvis resten ændres "
"dynamisk. Du kan også indtaste flere IP'er adskilt med et komma."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2517
msgid ""
"If you enter both a user-agent and an <glossterm>IP address</glossterm>, "
"both have to match to identify the bot."
msgstr ""
"Angiver du både en user-agent og en <glossterm>IP-adresse</glossterm>, skal "
"begge matche for at identificere botten."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2528
msgid "Mass email"
msgstr "Masse-e-mail"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2529
msgid ""
"phpBB allows you to send an e-mail or message to every user on the board, "
"which allows it in his <link linkend=\"ucp_preferences\">board "
"preferences</link>. The message can serve as a newsletter, notification "
"about changes on the board etc. You can choose whether to send the e-mail to"
" all users, a specific group or a list of specific users. The e-mail is sent"
" from the administrator's e-mail address and all recipients are included in "
"a BCC - Blind Carbon Copy."
msgstr ""
"phpBB giver dig mulighed for at sende en e-mail eller besked til alle "
"brugere på boardet, som tillader dette i deres <link "
"linkend=\"ucp_preferences\">boardindstillinger</link>. Beskeden kan fungere "
"som et nyhedsbrev, en notifikation om ændringer på boardet osv. Du kan vælge"
" om e-mailen skal sendes til alle brugere, en bestemt gruppe eller en liste "
"af specifikke brugere. E-mailen sendes fra administratorens e-mailadresse, "
"og alle modtagere inkluderes i en BCC - Blind Carbon Copy."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2530
msgid ""
"On some hosts, sending a mass e-mail can be a problem, since sometimes the "
"hosting company limits the number of e-mails that can be sent out at once. "
"phpBB includes only 50 recipients per e-mail and sends another one for the "
"next batch to prevent this, however, if you still are not able to send a "
"mass e-mail, consult the situation with your hosting provider."
msgstr ""
"På nogle webhosts kan afsendelse af en masse-e-mail være et problem, da "
"hostingfirmaet nogle gange begrænser antallet af e-mails, der kan sendes på "
"én gang. phpBB inkluderer kun 50 modtagere pr. e-mail og sender en ny til "
"den næste batch for at forhindre dette; kan du stadig ikke sende en masse-e-"
"mail, så kontakt din webhost om situationen."

#. (itstool) path: itemizedlist/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2532
msgid "Composing a mass e-mail"
msgstr "Skriv en masse-e-mail"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2533
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Send to group</guilabel>: Select the group you want to send the "
