#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2553
msgid "PHP Information"
msgstr "PHP-information"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2554
msgid ""
"This option will provide you with information about the version of PHP "
"installed on your server, along with information on loaded modules and the "
"configuration applicable to the current location. This information can be "
"useful to phpBB team members in helping you to diagnose problems affecting "
"your installation of phpBB. The information here can be security sensitive "
"and it is recommended that you only grant access to this option to those "
"users who need access to the information and do not disclose the information"
" unless necessary."
msgstr ""
"Denne mulighed giver dig information om den version af PHP, der er "
"installeret på din server, sammen med information om indlæste moduler og den"
" konfiguration, der gælder for den aktuelle placering. Denne information kan"
" være nyttig for phpBB-teammedlemmer til at hjælpe dig med at diagnosticere "
"problemer, der påvirker din phpBB-installation. Informationen her kan være "
"sikkerhedsfølsom, og det anbefales, at du kun giver adgang til denne "
"mulighed til de brugere, der har brug for adgang til informationen, og ikke "
"videregiver informationen, medmindre det er nødvendigt."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2555
msgid ""
"Please note that some hosting providers may limit the information which is "
"available to you on this page for security reasons."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk venligst at nogle webhostingudbydere kan begrænse den information, "
"der er tilgængelig for dig på denne side, af sikkerhedsmæssige årsager."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: admin_guide.xml:2565
msgid "Manage reasons for reporting and denying posts"
msgstr "Administrer årsager til rapportering og afvisning af indlæg"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2566
msgid ""
"phpBB has a feature that allows you to put new posts in queue, where the "
"post waits until it is approved or denied by a moderator, this can be set "
"with permissions or in the <guilabel>Post settings</guilabel> for users "
"which do not have enough posts. If a moderator chooses to deny a post in the"
" queue, he has an option to specify a reason for the denial. The predefined "
"options from which he can choose are specified here. These reasons are also "
"offered to users reporting a post on the board."
msgstr ""
"phpBB har en funktion, der giver dig mulighed for at sætte nye indlæg i kø, "
"hvor indlægget venter, indtil det godkendes eller afvises af en redaktør; "
"dette kan indstilles med tilladelser eller i "
"<guilabel>Indlægsindstillinger</guilabel> for brugere, som ikke har nok "
"indlæg. Vælger en redaktør at afvise et indlæg i køen, har vedkommende "
"mulighed for at angive en årsag til afvisningen. De foruddefinerede "
"muligheder, redaktøren kan vælge imellem, angives her. Disse årsager "
"tilbydes også til brugere, der rapporterer et indlæg på boardet."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: admin_guide.xml:2567
msgid ""
"For more information about queue moderation, see <xref "
"linkend=\"mcp_queue\"/>."
msgstr "For mere information om kømoderation, se <xref linkend=\"mcp_queue\"/>."

